Pocket allsell_allSell all0game_center_disconnect_account_confirmation_text˚The game is connected to Game Center. Would you like to disconnect the game from Game Center?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Game Center!6google_play_games_disconnect_account_confirmation_textçThe game is connected to Google Play Games. Would you like to disconnect the game from Google Play Games?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Google Play Games!dungeon_24_titleThe 3rd League of Superheroesalbum_ach_099_text/Clear 3rd League of Superheroes in Shadow Worldalbum_ach_098_text.Clear 3rd League of Superheroes in Light World1dungeon_unlock_condition_light_dungeons_completed/Clear Light World dungeons <nobr>%1 - %2</nobr>dungeon_27_commente"To sit here on the throne, all you have to do is<br>betray your entire family and all your friends."dungeon_completed_hint?<green>You have cleansed this place of all its horrors!</green>enemy_defeated_info_textàAnother enemy that will tremble with fear because of you in the future! Your next opponent is already impatiently awaiting his downfall.no_dungeon_open_info_text»Congratulations! You triumphantly rise from the dungeon victoriously! But without another key, the next dungeon remains locked and the enemies lurking behind it remain safe from you. At least for now.need_new_dungeon_key_info_text~Return after finding another key! There's nothing for you to do here at the moment. Your heroic services are needed elsewhere!no_dungeon_open_warningNo dungeon opendungeon_cleared_info_textæYou really live up to your name! These enemies were no match for your strength, but the next dungeon is already waiting. Wipe the sweat from your brow and jump straight into the next battle!next_dungeonNext dungeonfeature_unlock_doll_textvYou buy an old wooden doll...somehow it resembles you. You put your Sunday armor on it and lovingly dub it: mannequin.client_incompatible_text˝There is a new game version on world S31 (DE). Till the worldwide update you will not be able to play characters from other game worlds via this client. To play your character, go to %1 and select your game world or enter it directly in the address bar.monster_name_407bWarbling Birdie|That noise pollution is unbearable! Someone should give the beast a good plucking!monster_name_423/Snowflake|Summer is coming. And so is the thaw.monster_name_409ùTrickeribook's Cheatinchild|The story of his childhood seems very overwrought. I wonder if the survival techniques from the jungle will help him against you?item_type_14_pic_041U36960-feet boots|Enchant your footwear to shorten<br>traveling time on<br>adventures.feature_unlock_tower_textÆOnce upon a time, a hero and his three fearless companions entered the Tower bloodthirstily.<br><br>Click the Dungeons button, select the Tower and start your very own story! feature_unlock_demon_portal_text˜Plop! A portal to another world opens and suddenly you are facing a superior demon. If you manage to defeat it bit by bit, you will be granted a bonus on your hit points.<br><br>Click on Dungeons, choose Demon Portal and face the brutal challenge!dungeon_unlock_condition_towerUnlock the Tower
tower_nameTower(appleid_disconnect_app_confirmation_textêThe game is connected to Sign in with Apple. Would you like to disconnect the game from Sign in with Apple?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Sign in with Apple!2google_play_games_disconnect_app_confirmation_textçThe game is connected to Google Play Games. Would you like to disconnect the game from Google Play Games?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Google Play Games!,game_center_disconnect_app_confirmation_text˚The game is connected to Game Center. Would you like to disconnect the game from Game Center?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Game Center!*steam_disconnect_account_confirmation_text¯Would you like to disconnect your character from Steam so you can log in with name and password?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Steam!)facebook_disconnect_app_confirmation_textÔThe game is connected to Facebook. Do you want to disconnect the game from Facebook?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Facebook!0dungeon_unlock_condition_light_dungeon_completedClear Light World dungeon %11dungeon_unlock_condition_shadow_dungeon_completedClear Shadow World dungeon %1dungeon_22_level_04_textTWhat archaeologist has put these bones together wrong again? This must be corrected!monster_name_1168Supreme Alienitem_type_11_pic_044(Volcanic Key|"Just throw it in the fire"feature_unlock_toilet_textÁThere was no more time to waste! Finally, you can go to the toilet! Try flushing something down the toilet and see what happens!<br><br>From now on, click the Tavern button twice to literally flush your latest find down the toilet. feature_unlock_shadow_world_text°An ominous shadow covers the land and strengthens the power of the dungeon monsters.<br><br>However, you don't have to face this challenge alone. With brave companions by your side, you can make it through these dark times.<br><br>Click on Dungeons and choose the Shadow World if you dare.feature_unlock_holy_grail_textøShrouded in legend! From now on, items that are still missing in your scrapbook will wobble around merrily.<br><br>Who would have thought that thousands-of-years old relics could be so silly?feature_unlock_underworld_text≤Your greed has made you dig in the mine too deeply and now you are doomed to carry out the will of the underworld.<br><br>Press the Fortress button twice to reach the underworld.event_info_dealer_percentageKUp to %1% more mushrooms at the mushroom dealer to all basic mushroom packspayment_package_unavailablevThis pack cannot be purchased with the currently selected payment method.<br>Please select a different payment method.dungeon_23_level_02_textfThe person that created him is the real monster, but fortunately, you don't have to fight that person.feature_unlock_yt_dungeon_textŒSometimes it's better to keep your idols at a distance, especially if they are after you!<br><br>Click on Dungeons and select "Continuous Loop of Idols" when you're ready for a different kind of meet&greet.item_type_11_pic_014DCircus Ticket|" You are invited to the ring of the Circus of Terror"dungeon_26_level_08_texteThe triple clamor could be stopped if you knew something about knotting. But your weapon will do too.dungeon_25_level_03_text1Is one of those particularly intrusive neighbors.dungeon_25_level_02_text@Has the big dream of becoming a mayor, and you stand in his way.dungeon_24_level_03_textJAlways on his way to the next toilet, and he has to pass you to get there.dungeon_22_level_09_textCHe looks greedily at the gems in your armor and rushes towards you.feature_unlock_petnest_text±Collect, feed and train your pets to become the master of the pets! Check out your 5 new starter pets right now.<br><br>From now on, you can click the Stable to access the pets.dungeon_22_level_02_textProbably the last of his kind!feature_unlock_idle_game_text‡Why get your hands dirty in tough fights in the arena when others can do the same?<br><br>Become an arena manager and build your entertainment empire.<br><br>Click the Arena button twice and enter the world of entrepreneurs!twister_overview_descriptionÄIt's all haywire here.<br>A huge twister is sweeping through the land and has drawn 1,000 monsters in its inside along with you.feature_unlock_twister_text∆Not only fists fly here, but also the tears of your opponents as you finish off one after the other without pause.<br><br>Draw your weapon, click the Dungeons button, select the Twister and go wild!feature_unlock_wheel_textªWhat a lucky find! From now on, you can also win souls, arcane splinters and fruits for your pets on the wheel of fortune.<br><br>As usual, you can click on Dr. Abawuwu to test your luck!"dungeon_feature_locked_descriptionÉReach <info>level 10</info> to show that you got what it takes to be a real adventurer and gain access to the first dungeon.<br><br>According to rumors, enemies in dungeons are even more powerful, but in return, victorious adventurers will be rewarded richly.gt_chests_claimable_yesterday%Chests you did not collect yesterday:gt_daily_level_up_textgCongratulations! You've collected enough <info>Hell Tokens</info> with your guild to unlock new chests!gt_no_chests_from_yesterdayFYou already collected all chests your guild earned together yesterday.tower_overview_description@Once upon a time there was an adventurer and three companions...dungeon_feature_locked_titleDungeons - locked"single_portal_overview_description?Challenge the overly powerful demon in the portal once per day.2dungeon_unlock_condition_key_adventure_weapon_shopnFind the key <info>on a quest</info> or buy it in the <info>weapon shop</info> after fulfilling the following:1dungeon_unlock_condition_key_adventure_magic_shopmFind the key <info>on a quest</info> or buy it in the <info>magic shop</info> after fulfilling the following:%dungeon_unlock_condition_key_gem_mineIFind the key <info>in the gem mine</info> after fulfilling the following:&dungeon_unlock_condition_key_adventureDFind the key <info>on a quest</info> after fulfilling the following:portal_single_explanation‡You can enter the portal and fight once a day. Portal enemies regenerate their hit points by 10% every day.<br><br>By winning fights you get a bonus on your hit points. This bonus is increased by one percentage for each win.floating_text_new_enemy
New enemy!tutorial_title_mirror_shardsMirror Shardspush_status_allowedStatus: allowedpush_status_deniedStatus: deniedfeature_unlock_album_textúTo wallow in the memories of your heroic deeds, you take a picture of everything and stick it in your scrapbook neatly. Nothing beats a well-maintained catalogue of your achievements!<br><br>Start collecting and check your progress by clicking the glowing book in your character view.!feature_unlock_mirror_shards_textºOuch! Watch out! Mirror shards can be very sharp, but also very useful!<br><br>Go on an adventure and collect all the shards of the magic mirror to literally bring your reflection to life!dungeon_25_level_08_text!The epitome of toxic masculinity.monster_name_1162%Friendly Helper from the Neighborhooddungeon_22_level_08_textjPetDex entry 006:<br><br>"This pet can melt wax with its fire breath. It occasionally causes house fires."feature_unlock_black_smith_text≤Whack! Bang! Poof! With a few powerful hammer blows, the blacksmith can make your equipment shine again.<br><br>Click the Weapon Shop twice to get the most out of your equipment.dungeon_22_level_06_text.Defeat it quickly before its mommy comes back.feature_unlock_fortress_textãCongratulations, you are a landowner now! This is your chance to build a magnificent fortress for you and your people.<br><br>Protect yourself from enemy attacks and storm the fortress walls of other players on raids.<br><br>Click the Fortress button and get started!feature_unlock_witch_textÀTee-hee and hocus pocus! The witch has moved into the back room of the magic shop and casts spells on you...er, your items.<br><br>From now on, visit the witch by clicking twice on the Magic Shop button.event_info_special_packMThe mushroom dealer has a special pack that is only offered during the event.feature_unlock_light_world_text∞With this key you can finally enter your first dungeon. But beware, the dungeons are teeming with powerful monsters. If you defeat them, however, there is also fat loot waiting for you. So what are you waiting for?<br><br>Click on Dungeons and select Light World in the overview to take on the challenge!$feature_unlock_mirror_completed_text¯Two are better than one!!! From now on, your reflection stands by your side. <br><br>With its support, you can simultaneously fight in the arena or dungeons while completing an adventure or being on a city guard shift. Doesn't that sound lucrative?event_info_special_packsPThe mushroom dealer has %1 special packs that are only offered during the event.payment_change_provider!Select a different payment methodalbum_ach_095_titleChaser of Dragonsalbum_ach_096_titleBright Ghost Hunteralbum_ach_097_titleDark Ghost Hunteralbum_ach_098_titleLeague of Incompetencealbum_ach_099_titleLeague of Vindictivenessalbum_ach_100_titleYing Dojo Masteralbum_ach_101_titleYang Dojo Masteralbum_ach_103_titleTamer of Giantsalbum_ach_102_titleUnderstander of Giants-dungeon_unlock_condition_light_dungeon_levels:Defeat the monster on floor %2 from Light World dungeon %1.dungeon_unlock_condition_shadow_dungeon_levels;Defeat the monster on floor %2 from Shadow World dungeon %1dungeon_22_titleDragon's Hoardmonster_name_1130Not So Snappy Dragondungeon_22_level_01_text3A memorial to the consequences of poor dental care.monster_name_1131$Golden Dragon with Fiery-Eyed Glancedungeon_22_level_03_text$It's not just the size that matters!monster_name_1133Undead Saurian Fossilmonster_name_1134Shenlongdungeon_22_level_05_text;Grants you a wish as long as it has to do with your demise.monster_name_1135Baby Dragonmonster_name_1136New Year's Dragonmonster_name_1138Dragon with Concussionmonster_name_1139Annoyed Mother of Dragonsdungeon_22_level_10_textCIf you don't get rid of her now, she could turn into a big problem.dungeon_23_titleHouse of Horrorsmonster_name_1140Cutlery Headdungeon_23_level_01_texteA modern interpretation of the ideal of beauty. If you don't like it, you'll get punched in the face!monster_name_1142Draculadungeon_23_level_03_text,To him you're just banked blood on two legs.monster_name_1143Master of Phone Pranksdungeon_23_level_04_textOh, is that your phone ringing?monster_name_1144Lovable Twins-facebook_disconnect_account_confirmation_textÛThe game is connected via Facebook. Would you like to disconnect the game from Facebook?<br><br><red>Attention!</red> A password must have been set before disconnecting. Otherwise you will lose access to your characters connected via Facebook!dungeon_23_level_05_text'They just want to play a game with you!monster_name_1145Friendly Sewer Clowndungeon_23_level_06_text8He offers you a balloon and you grab it in anticipation.monster_name_1146Therapist's Dolldungeon_23_level_07_textNBy trying to snuff you, he just wants to help you get your life back on track.monster_name_1147Your Worst Nightmaremonster_name_1148Butcher Next Doordungeon_23_level_09_text4He just wants to refine his filleting skills on you.monster_name_1149	Tube Girldungeon_23_level_10_text5Many impatient adventurers have fallen victim to her.monster_name_11501,000 Punch Mandungeon_24_level_01_text/Defeats each of his opponents with 1,000 blows.monster_name_1151Mister X-Raydungeon_24_level_02_textXThe horror of every woman's locker room, but he'd rather fight you with his eyes closed.monster_name_1152Toilet Trackermonster_name_1153Iron Mandungeon_24_level_04_text-Irons his opponents' shirts at any sacrifice.monster_name_1154Rain Mandungeon_24_level_05_text$Never has to ask for a phone number.monster_name_1155Invisible Womanmonster_name_1156	Candy Manmonster_name_1157Captain Caffeinedungeon_24_level_08_text3Has the effect of 100 cups of coffee after one cup.monster_name_1158Forgetful Fistdungeon_24_level_09_textHHas the strongest superpower of them all if only he could remember it...monster_name_1159Captain Mondaydungeon_24_level_10_textMHas a chronic hangover and there's only one thing that helps: a good beating!dungeon_25_titleDojo of Childhood Heroesmonster_name_1160Magical Schoolgirldungeon_25_level_01_text<Defeat her quickly before she finishes changing her clothes!monster_name_1167Joseph Jokermonster_name_1161Master of Doppelgangersmonster_name_1163Student Shinigamidungeon_25_level_04_text+Probably has to compensate for something...monster_name_1164Wannabe Detectivedungeon_25_level_05_text+A serious danger with his Swiss wristwatch.monster_name_1165Rubber Piratemonster_name_1166Pet Trainerdungeon_25_level_07_text"Becoming the very best takes time.monster_name_1169Cheating Bratdungeon_25_level_10_text%Believes in the heart of card tricks.dungeon_26_level_10_textBConsiders destroying the world, should anyone say "expresso" againitem_type_11_pic_0788Cursed Key|"After touching it your hand turns all black"album_ach_102_text#Clear Monster Grotto in Light Worldalbum_ach_103_text$Clear Monster Grotto in Shadow Worlddungeon_26_titleMonster Grottomonster_name_1170Doltopusmonster_name_1171Hairy Groomdungeon_26_level_02_textSYou're interrupting his honeymoon... and don't worry - size really does not matter.monster_name_1172Monster Truckdungeon_26_level_03_text-To him you are nothing more than a small car.monster_name_1173Nudist Giantdungeon_26_level_04_text4Occasionally nibbles on one or the other adventurer.monster_name_1174Marshmallow Mandungeon_26_level_05_textaSticky, sweet and hot? Better wipe the drool from your mouth and finish off this wobbly dumpling!monster_name_1175Sandbox Wormdungeon_26_level_06_text1Be careful not to step on his little sand castle.monster_name_1176Optimist Supremedungeon_26_level_07_text#Honk once if you think you can win!monster_name_1177Three-headed Dragon Godmonster_name_1178Angry Giant Sauriandungeon_26_level_09_textVVisiting from Tokyo with bad intentions, and you intrude the planned sightseeing tour.monster_name_1179Berlin Scene Monsteritem_type_11_pic_0128Devilish Spare Key|"Was actually just under the doormat"item_type_11_pic_0139Key to the 13th Floor|"Some doors are better left locked"item_type_11_pic_0168Magic Key|"Fell out of the pocket of some big hairy guy"client_incompatible_title-Playing with this client version not possibledungeon_25_comment%"Land of big eyes and bleeding noses"dungeon_23_comment3"They are more afraid of you than you are of them!"dungeon_26_level_01_text\It's a pity you only speak Whalish. You probably will have to let your weapon speak for you.dungeon_25_level_09_text0The more blonde the hair, the greater the power.dungeon_25_level_06_text(Unfortunately, only has air in his head.dungeon_24_level_07_textBAfter eating one of his dubious sweets, you are easy game for him.dungeon_24_level_06_text4Can turn invisible, but only when no one is looking.dungeon_23_level_08_textJThe fact that he now pursues you even when you are awake must be punished!monster_name_1132Seductive Mother of Drankeysmonster_name_1141Conceptual Proofdungeon_22_comment&"Did you pack your fire extinguisher?"album_ach_095_text$Clear Dragon's Hoard in Shadow Worldalbum_ach_096_text%Clear House of Horrors in Light Worldalbum_ach_097_text&Clear House of Horrors in Shadow Worlddungeon_28_comment'"The cool kids always sit in the back."dungeon_30_comment("Always open for constructive criticism"item_type_11_pic_0790The Key|"You pulled it off from an ugly Smollum"dungeon_29_comment"Evil dwells here"item_type_11_pic_066@Dark Magical Key|"Your opportunity to prove what you've learned"dungeon_27_titleCity of Intriguesitem_type_11_pic_029JKey to the City Gate|"Let someone say again that the city cannot be taken"item_type_11_pic_077-Key to the Back Door|"Every assassin's dream"dungeon_29_titleAsh Mountaindungeon_30_titlePlaya HQitem_type_11_pic_045,Office Key|"Whoever lost it should be fired"item_type_11_pic_080;Key from the Boss|"With this key you'll make it to the top"dungeon_28_titleSchool of Magic Expressalbum_ach_094_titleDragon Adeptalbum_ach_094_text#Clear Dragon's Hoard in Light Worldalbum_ach_101_text.Clear Dojo of Childhood Heroes in Shadow Worldalbum_ach_100_text-Clear Dojo of Childhood Heroes in Light Worldmonster_name_6052Decadent Connoisseurmonster_name_6053Sugar Rush Gnomemonster_name_6054Flat Rate Party Orcmonster_name_6055Competition Eatermonster_name_6056Feeding Frenzy Alliesmonster_name_6057Glutton Couplemonster_name_6058Voracious Teammonster_name_6059Hyperphagia Friendsmonster_name_6060Crapulous Companionsmonster_name_6061Unbridled Contemporariesmonster_name_6062Starved Comradesmonster_name_6063Dionysusmonster_name_6064Gluttonous Gaulgt_gluttony_1_titlePlain of Excessive Gluttonygt_gluttony_1_desczThe stench down here reminds you of the lunch box from your gym sack that has been there since before the summer holidays.dungeon_22_level_07_textLuck is on his side today.monster_name_1137Pet Out of Controlalbum_ach_008_text'Clear City of Intrigues in Shadow Worldalbum_ach_061_text-Clear School of Magic Express in Shadow Worldalbum_ach_062_text"Clear Ash Mountain in Shadow Worldtwister_explanationzIf you defeat an enemy in the Twister and still have at least 90% of your hit points, you can try the next floor for free!class_name_1_plWarriorsalbum_ach_006_text&Clear City of Intrigues in Light Worldclass_name_2_plMagesclass_name_3_plScoutsclass_name_4_pl	Assassinsclass_name_5_plBattle Magesclass_name_7_plDemon Huntersclass_name_8_plDruidsclass_name_9_plBardsclass_name_6_pl
Berserkersevent_info_gems_blackfriday-Only black and Legendary gems in the gem mineevent_info_quest_mushrooms'Increased chance of mushrooms on questspush_send_notificationsSend notificationsitem_type_13_pic_001Scrapbook of meticulousness starterpack_12_blackfriday_titleUltimate Black Friday Packstarterpack_9_blackfriday_titleBlack Friday Pack starterpack_10_blackfriday_titleSuper Black Friday Pack starterpack_11_blackfriday_titleUltra Black Friday Packdungeon_19_level_01_text[If you say something against his mother, you automatically insult his nine sisters as well.dungeon_19_level_02_text?All Odin's messengers send today is just you...to kingdom come.dungeon_19_level_03_text4She has reserved you a cosy place in the underworld.dungeon_19_level_04_textZHis palace with 540 halls is the biggest in Asgard ever built. No vacancies for you today.dungeon_19_level_05_textKOffers you cremation here and now to free your soul from your irksome body.dungeon_19_level_06_textlHe is more beautiful than you, more evil than you and outshines you in cleverness and any kind of deception.dungeon_19_level_07_textÇSon and daughter have arisen from the sweat under his left arm. You can imagine what will happen when he coughs in your direction.dungeon_19_level_08_textEA moody animal that could hug the whole world and bites its own tail.dungeon_19_level_09_textDHas just torn his indestructible magic chains and eyes you hungrily.dungeon_19_level_10_textrA giant who sets the world on fire, flings flames in all directions and annihilates all life...beginning with you.dungeon_20_level_01_text8Can you still call this singing or is it rather battery?dungeon_20_level_02_textAn eye for an eye!dungeon_20_level_03_textXThis hellhound does not let mortals in the underworld. You know what this means for you.dungeon_20_level_04_textIf looks could kill...dungeon_20_level_05_text7You need a new strategy against the Goddess of Tactics.dungeon_20_level_06_text$Looks like a Herculean task for you.dungeon_20_level_07_text:Your last words: "the God of War, finally a worthy enemy!"dungeon_20_level_08_textcYou won‚Äôt become friends anymore. You already ‚Äúmet‚Äù his friend Medusa and his son Polyphemus.dungeon_20_level_09_text=After this fight the King of the Dead will also be your king.dungeon_20_level_10_textAHint: in a thunderstorm you should cling to a beech like a leech.item_type_10_pic_063aSack Presents|"Modesty is a virtue<br>but many think that greed is, too."<br>‚Äí Merry Christmas! fight_result_text_type_5_lost_254A lof of heroes came, saw and conquered. Unlike you.dungeon_18_text.Into the tube you wanna stare? Don't you dare!portal_single_bonus_infoHPortal bonus: +%1 hit points (+%2%)<br>Next level: +%3 hit points (+%4%)!dungeon_enemy_title_portal_singleDemon's Portal act %1, %2 dungeon_enemy_text_portal_singleˇEnemy: %1<br>Hit points: %2%<br><br>You can enter the portal and fight once a day. Portal enemies regenerate their hit points by 10% every day.<br>Defeating portal enemies gives you a bonus to your hit points. Every defeated enemy boosts this bonus by 1%.dungeon_enemy_text_portalEnemy: %1<br>Hit points: %2%item_type_11_pic_030ûMirror Shard of Misfortune|"Breaking a mirror,<br>brings 7 years bad luck.<br><br>But what if you put<br>an ill-fated mirror back<br>together piece by piece?"dungeon_unlock_condition_key(Get the key by fulfilling the following:"attribute_line_class_hint_3_weapon@<class hint>Required class: Scout, Demon Hunter</class hint><br>attribute_line_class_hint_14<class hint>Required class: warrior</class hint><br>!attribute_line_class_hint_2_armor:<class hint>Required class: (Battle) Mage</class hint><br>"attribute_line_class_hint_2_weapon><class hint>Required class: Mage, Druid, Bard</class hint><br>!attribute_line_class_hint_1_armorP<class hint>Required class: Warrior, Berserker,<br>Demon Hunter</class hint><br>"attribute_line_class_hint_1_weaponY<class hint>Required class: Warrior, Assassin,<br>Battle Mage, Berserker</class hint><br>!attribute_line_class_hint_3_armorL<class hint>Required class: Scout, Assassin,<br>Druid, Bard</class hint><br>portal_cooldown_notice_overview See you tomorrow<br>- the demons
legal_infoÇ<link:tos>ToS</link> <link:privacy>Privacy policy</link> <link:imprint>Imprint</link><br><link:cookie>Revoke cookie consent</link>manualManualsupportSupportforumForummonster_name_5217Chief Kidnapping Officermonster_name_5209Smombiemonster_name_5206Malicious Bartendermonster_name_5208Unbidden Break Danceritem_type_09_pic_104BPot of Gold|"You are always at the end<br>of the rainbow with it."bard_info_armorIThe Bard's harp increases the maximum<br>damage reduction during a fight.item_type_08_pic_104(The Ankh|"Whoever loots it may keep it."item_type_10_pic_104Trojan Pony|"Was a gift..."monster_name_5210Junk Food Junkiemonster_name_5211Party Corpsemonster_name_5212	Shot Kingmonster_name_5213Unpleasant Influencermonster_name_5214"Head of Department for Basic Needsmonster_name_5215Head of Marketing Departmentmonster_name_5216The Project Managerdruid_tutorial_title_1	The Druidstats_armorZArmor increases your damage reduction.<br>This reduces the damage you<br>suffer in battle.dmg_reduct_expl>Damage reduction<br><grey>= %1 / enemy level%2; max. %3</grey>damage_bonusDamage bonusmonster_name_5207	Cookroachdive_attack_chance_baseBasic chance of swoop: %1evasion_chance_hypenEvasion chancemax_crit_chanceMax. crit. chancedive_attack_damageSwoop damage
yt_dungeonContinuous Loop<br>of Idolsdungeon_enemy_levelLvl. %1maxmax. %1 crit_attribute_explanation_short= %1 * 5 / (enemy level * 2)critical_damage_bonus_abbrCrit. dmg bonuscritical_hit_damage_bonusCrit. hit damage bonusyt_dungeon_overview_descriptionJFight together with your companions against your idols from another world. light_world_overview_description%Powerful enemies are waiting for you!!shadow_world_overview_descriptionGFight together with your companions against even more powerful enemies!attribute_explanation_3_otheroIntelligence is the main attribute of<br>mages, druids and bards.<br>It helps you defend yourself against them.attribute_explanation_3_ownhIntelligence is the main attribute of<br>mages, druids and bards.<br>It increases your inflicted damage.demonhunter_revival_potion_infoùFlask of Resurrection<br>44% chance of being resurrected with 90% hit points.<br>Every time you get resurrected in one fight the chance<br>is reduced by 2% and the amount of regenerated<br>hit points is reduced by 10%.<br><red>The potion doesn't work if you got killed by a mage.</red>fight_with_companions#Fight together with your companionsdungeon_unlock_condition_levelReach level %1light_worldLight Worlddot_boss_30oThe champagne is for the management level only. For you they only have cheap sparkling wine and a good beating.dot_boss_31NWith this badly organized party she only sees one way to restore order here...dot_boss_29YYou could have become good drinking buddies, but now you are facing each other in battle.dot_boss_32AAn aura of ice-cold calculating efficiency seems to surround her.error_player_not_found_textxThe character was not found on this game world. Maybe it has been renamed by our support or deleted from another device.item_type_07_class_2_pic_057_Belt of confident superiority|"Much more popular than<br>the 'Necklace of humiliating defeat'."	exp_mount°You will be twice as fast with this mount!<br>This means there is <white>50% reduced travel duration</white><br>and each adventure costs only half of the thirst.exp_goldÑGold is the <white>main currency</white> in the game,<br>you can buy weapons and gear for<br>gold, or also increase your attributes.exp_lifepotionNThe Potion of Eternal Life increases<br>your <white>Hit Points by 25%</white>.checkoutPurchase Informationexp_hourglassesdYou can <white>skip</white> the travel time during<br>an <white>adventure</white> with an hourglass.	exp_metalXMetal is used by the <white>blacksmith</white><br>to improve your weapons and equipment.
exp_arcanedArcane splinters are used by the <white>blacksmith</white><br>to improve your weapons and equipment.exp_levelupWYou are showered with <white>experience</white> and<br>immediately gain one more level.exp_luckycoinsSDr. Abawuwu's lets you spin his<br><white>Wheel of Fortune</white> for Lucky Coins.todo_list_text_wheel>Fidget Spinner|Spin Dr. Abawuwu's Wheel of Fortune. (%1 of %2)item_type_12_pic_020Arcane splinters	exp_soulsNYou can upgrade your buildings in<br>the <white>Underworld</white> with souls.!lists_tab_hall_of_fame_underworld
Underworld	exp_stoneLYou can upgrade your buildings in<br>the <white>fortress</white> with stone.exp_woodKYou can upgrade your buildings in<br>the <white>fortress</white> with wood.exp_mushrooms∏Those special mushrooms are on one hand<br>a popular <white>currency</white> at the merchants,<br>but on the other hand, you can also use them <br>to <white>skip waiting times</white>.inventory_space_neededInventory space required!mount_replace_warningCurrent mount will be replaced!gt_fraud_3_descrYou received for the 500th time the same item, but next time it will definitely be the super rare Limited Edition.gt_fraud_3_title Plain of the addictive lootboxesgt_lust_2_descÄIn front of you a sight emerges that demands things like cold showers and not just the burning hot wind is responsible for that.gt_lust_1_desc5Rumor has it that Shakes never got past this floor...gt_fraud_1_titlePlain of getting ripped offgt_fraud_1_descqYou're being made the most fantastic promises from all sides and slowly but surely, you're running out of doubts.gt_chest_blacksmithBlacksmith's Chestgt_tutorial_text_06ÃBeelzebub realised that someone ventures through the Hellevator and offers you <info>Hellevator Treats</info>. You can get them by paying with your Key Cards. He also takes mushrooms should you not have any. <br><br>The Hellevator Treats come in all sorts and add a <info>positive effect on your combat power in the Hellevator</info>. Also, Beelzebub is <info>improving his treats daily.</info> Therefore, from the second day onwards, all treats grant more damage to your weapon as an additional effect.<br><br>When you buy a treat, you will eat them directly and keep the specific effect for a certain amount of floors. You can only eat one treat at a time. Should you eat a second one, the first treat will expire.gt_chests_earned_yesterday5Your guild earned <info>%1 chest(s)</info> yesterday.gt_tutorial_text_04‰<info>Should you leave your guild</info> during the event, you take your Hell Tokens with you and can join a new guild at any time. However, <info>you will lose %1% of your Hell Tokens</info>. You can continue fighting in the Hellevator and collect Hell Tokens but your Hell Tokens won't be added to those of your new guild for %2 hours.<br><br>If you get kicked from the guild, you won't lose any Hell Tokens. Your Hell Tokens will be added to those of your new guild after %3 hours.gt_tutorial_text_02ïEach fight costs <info>one Key Card</info>. Every <info>%1 minutes</info> a new Key Card is generated. If you have collected a <info>maximum of %2 Key Cards</info>, no more will be generated. Don't forget to use them regularly!<br><br>If you don't have a Key Card at hand, you can also pay a mushroom to plunge into battle.<br><br>Should you find Key Cards elsewhere, they will always fit in your pockets.gt_daily_bar_maxMax. reached for today!gt_daily_max_rewardMCongratulations! You received all the chests for today. Start again tomorrow!gt_daily_next_rewardNext chest:gt_collected_chestsEarned Chestsgt_chest_blacksmith_contentContains <arcane> and <metal>gt_chest_fortress_contentContains <wood> and <stone>gt_chest_fortressFortress Chestgt_chest_gold_contentContains <gold>gt_chest_gold
