day are special. For each victory you are not only rewarded with honor and gold but also XP. (%3/10 remaining)album_tab_stats_6Achievements<br>%1/%2gt_rankRankname_and_levelName / Levelgt_best_floorBest %1dot_subtitle_wizard,Fantastic Legendaries and Where to Find Themclaimable_forClaimable for %1album_tab_legendaryöLegendary Items<br>Legendary Items don't increase<br>the scrapbook progress,<br>but they increase the chance<br>of finding Legendary Gems in the gem mine!task_dot_fight*Defeat %1 enemies in the Legendary Dungeontask_legendaryFind a Legendary Itemdot_tutorial_text_02æ<info>Legendary Items</info> are particularly powerful and have a unique look. You can only find them in Legendary Dungeons. You can't unlock them in your own scrapbook by defeating other players.<br><br>The more Legendary Items you have collected in your scrapbook, the higher your chance of obtaining <info>Legendary Gems</info> in the gem mine. Legendary Gems provide especially large bonuses to both your main attribute and your constitution.dot_tutorial_text_03◊In the event you meet your (certain) demise during your Legendary Dungeon run, don't worry! You'll have to leave the dungeon, but you can return later and continue playing from that point, once you have recovered enough hit points.<br><br>You need <info>at least %1% of your total hit points</info> to enter the Legendary Dungeon. Your hit points will fully recover on their own within %2 hours, but you can also eat some mushrooms to return to your dungeon crawl sooner.dot_debuff_description_1%Enemy deals + %2% damage for %1 roomsdot_tutorial_text_06“Once you have defeated one of the <info>three mini bosses</info>, you can select one of three <info>Gems of Fate</info> ‚Äì powerful gems that will help you beat the dungeon and whose power stays with you until you have slain the final boss. But beware! Each of the gems not only bestows an <info>advantage but also a disadvantage</info>.&fort_secret_resource_depot_descriptionØWood and stone that you find outside the fortress will be kept safe in the secret storage. These resources can‚Äôt be raided, and you can add them to your storage at any time.dot_wizard_floor_3Wing of the Futuredot_wizard_floor_4
