th mushrooms!buy_mushroomsBuy <mushroom>serverstart_not_available'Function only available at server startflag_selectionFlag in the Hall of Famedungeon_unavailable_speedserver5This dungeon is not available<br>on the Speed Server.hourshrsevent_name_blackfridayBlack Fridayevent_name_speedSpeed Servercreate_accountCreate characterserverstart_validate_infoOnly before launch!pet_requirements_shadow_15ZCan be found in<br>Black Forest on Halloween<br>during the event "Crazy Mushroom Harvest".save_account_info_var¶Secure your character by registering now. Your character will be permanently saved and cannot get lost anymore!<br><br>Moreover, you can play on other devices and also buy mushrooms from the mushroom dealer.<br><br><info>You'll receive %1 <mushroom> for free for validating your account!</info> serverstart_overlay_advantage_01MValidate your character before launch and we will gift you %1 <mushroom> now!serverstart_validate_textBValidate your character before launch and claim %1 <mushroom> now!gof_effect_monster_doors"There may be monsters behind doorserror_you_are_not_invited_textvYour guild invitation might have been canceled in the meantime. Please contact the guild leader of the inviting guild.%payment_error_purchase_cancelled_text&The payment process has been canceled.&payment_error_purchase_cancelled_titlePayment canceled!payment_error_user_cancelled_text!Payment process canceled by user.item_unknownNot available yetwheel_try_button_popuphYou can spin the wheel up to %1x<br>a day. The first try<br>is always free.<br><br>Today's spins: %2/%3.gof_effect_hp_chest_damage_pos1Reduces the damage from sacrificial chests by %1%gof_effect_barrel_buff_neg;Increases the chance to suffer a curse from a barrel by %1%album_ach_092_text:Clear the Tavern of the Dark Doppelgangers in Shadow Worldalbum_ach_091_text9Clear the Tavern of the Dark Doppelgangers in Light Worlddot_tutorial_gofÃTo get to the final boss, you must defeat a mini boss at the end of each dungeon floor first.<br><br>Each time you can choose one of 3 Gems of Fate as a reward. Gems of Fate possess the power to alter your dungeon. Their powers are broken by defeating the final boss. You can choose new Gems of Fate on every subsequent dungeon run.gof_name_15Hope of the Thirsty Onemonster_name_5155Thirsty Waitergof_effect_curse_trapsTraps inflict curses#gof_effect_container_extra_buff_posIIncreases the chance of a blessing from chests, crates and corpses by %1%gof_effect_hp_negTAfter dying and entering the dungeon again, suffer the curse "Poisoned" for %1 roomsgof_effect_hp_pos]After dying and entering the dungeon again, gain the blessing "Road to Recovery" for %1 roomsgof_effect_more_unknown_roomsMore mysterious rooms appeargof_effect_less_unknown_roomsFewer mysterious rooms appeargof_effect_barrel_debuff_negBarrels contain only cursesgof_effect_more_debuff_chests0Cursed chests can also spawn behind closed doorsgof_effect_hp_chest_damage_neg3Increases the damage from sacrificial chests by %1%dot_buff_active_doorsUsable for %1 locked doorsdot_buff_active_doorUsable for one locked doorgof_effect_more_trapsMore traps spawngof_effects_less_debuff_doorsFewer cursed doors spawngof_effect_less_debuff_doorsFewer cursed doors spawngof_effect_no_epic_chestsNo epic chests spawngof_effect_always_traps&One of the two doors always has a trapgof_effect_stronger_monsterStronger monsters spawngof_effect_weaker_monsterWeaker monsters spawngof_effect_more_hp_chests5Sacrificial chests can also spawn behind closed doorsmonster_name_5160Head of Fun Departmentitem_type_05_class_1_pic_104MDragon Mittens|"Clever upcycling: freshly thrown out,<br>quickly repurposed."item_type_03_class_1_pic_104JIcarus Wings|"Built by experts and used<br>for the test flight just once."event_name_luckyday	Lucky Daygof_name_01Eye of the Bullgof_name_02Soul of the Rabbitgof_name_03Boulder of Greedgof_name_04Emerald of the Explorergof_name_05Pearl of the Masochistgof_name_06Pendant of the Key Mastergof_name_07Pebble of Deceitgof_name_08Greasy Healing Stonegof_name_09
Spying Gemgof_name_10	Lodestonegof_name_11Boulder of the Gamblergof_name_12Old Sacrificial Stonegof_name_13Blood Drop of Sacrificegof_name_23Rusty Healing Stonegof_name_18Cursed Moonstonegof_name_16Erratic Boulder of the Hickgof_name_14Kidney Stone of Determinationgof_name_17Sapphire of the Misadventurergof_name_19Diamond of the Time Travelergof_name_20Treasure of the Herogof_name_21Crown Jewel of the Devilgof_name_22Cursed Pearl"dot_tutorial_container_corpse_text@See if he has something useful in his pockets... but be careful!dot_tutorial_monster_textoYou can heroically defeat this enemy and search the pockets for a key...or you can try to escape like a coward!dot_tutorial_door_trap_textBEntering the door requires a lot of courage...and some hit points.tip_never_show_againNever show this hint again dot_tutorial_container_buff_textYUnfortunately, you only know afterwards if its seductive scent was a blessing or a curse.dot_tutorial_container_hp_textgTo open this chest you have to sacrifice some of your hit points. In return, you get some special loot.!dot_tutorial_container_curse_textBOpening this chest curses you, but you also get some special loot.dot_tutorial_door_curse_text7Opening this door curses you, but you don't need a key.!dot_tutorial_container_chest_text:Open it quickly because whoever sees it first can keep it!"dot_tutorial_container_chest_titleAh, a chest!'dot_tutorial_container_chest_epic_titleAn epic chest&dot_tutorial_container_chest_epic_text.Every day is a good day to get some epic loot. dot_tutorial_container_box_titleWho put this old crate here?dot_tutorial_container_box_textLThere can only be cheap stuff in here, but let's be honest...loot is loot...!dot_tutorial_container_buff_title+This barrel is both a curse and a blessing!#dot_tutorial_container_corpse_title*A fallen warrior...or is he just sleeping?dot_tutorial_monster_titleAn enemy gets in your way!dot_tutorial_door_curse_titleWatch out! A cursed door!dot_tutorial_door_hp_titleAttention! A sacrificial door!dot_tutorial_door_hp_text^You don't need a key to open this door. You have to sacrifice some of your hit points instead.%dot_tutorial_door_locked_double_titleI think I'm seeing double!$dot_tutorial_door_locked_double_text;You have to hand over two keys for this double-locked door.dot_tutorial_door_locked_titleOh no! Locked!dot_tutorial_door_locked_text\If you don't have any keys, you should "kindly ask" the inhabitants of the dungeon for some.#dot_tutorial_door_locked_epic_titleThis door looks epic!"dot_tutorial_door_locked_epic_text7Rumor has it that there is epic loot behind epic doors.dot_tutorial_door_trap_titleCareful! A trap!dot_tutorial_door_monster_textE...an enemy is waiting behind this door to teach you fear and terror.dot_tutorial_door_special_textbThe rooms behind these doors are unique and very special - whether good or bad remains to be seen.dot_tutorial_door_monster_title.These shining eyes can only mean one thing....dot_tutorial_door_dark_titleAh, a mysterious door.dot_tutorial_door_dark_textJYou have to go and see for yourself to find out what's behind these doors.dot_tutorial_door_boss_titleGet ready! It smells like boss!dot_tutorial_door_boss_textOThere's a really strong enemy behind this door...but with really precious loot.dot_debuff_description_5BFor %1 rooms twice as many keys are required for every locked door dot_tutorial_door_merchant_title&Get your keys out! It's shopping time!dot_tutorial_door_merchant_textRThe Key Master's Shop is behind this door. As we all know, looking around is free. dot_tutorial_door_unlocked_titleHow lucky! An unlocked door!dot_tutorial_door_unlocked_textaYou don't need a key for this door. Get in quickly and don't forget to close the door behind you!dot_tutorial_container_hp_titleLook, a sacrificial chest!"dot_tutorial_container_curse_titleLook, a cursed chest!dot_overview_floor_completedFloor completeddot_tutorial_door_special_title&It's blinding my eyes...a golden room!gof_select_textRAs a reward, you receive a Gem of Fate. Choose wisely and create your own destiny!dot_misc_treat_3HThey call you "fresh meat" down here...and you should take it literally.item_type_12_pic_022Lucky Coinsdot_misc_treat_5?Hurry up! The heads of department always eat up the appetizers.dungeon_21_comment "Old friends become new enemies"dot_misc_treat_7FIf you don't get out of here quickly, you'll end up as cheese nibbles.dot_misc_treat_4?I heard there is group yoga going on in the team building room.dot_misc_treat_1@This dungeon reeks of trouble...and a smack of strawberry punch.dot_misc_treat_66Since when do fingernails belong in a champagne punch?dot_misc_treat_2TMortal danger lies ahead of you! But isn't this a small price for a party like that?gof_effect_heal_pos!Healings give %1% more hit pointsgof_effect_item_chance_pos,Increases the chance of finding items by %1%gof_effect_hp_door_damage_neg2Increases the damage from sacrificial doors by %1%gof_effect_barrel_buff_tier_pos:Increases the chance of better blessings in barrels by %1%gof_effect_monster_damage_neg-Increases the damage dealt by monsters by %1%!gof_effect_debuff_tier_chance_neg.Increases the chance of stronger curses by %1%gof_effect_buff_duration_pos)Increases the duration of blessings by %1gof_effect_debuff_duration_neg&Increases the duration of curses by %1gof_effect_flee_damage_neg8Increases the damage from a failed escape attempt by %1%gof_effect_flee_chance_pos=Increases the chance of successful escapes from fights by %1%$gof_effect_monster_debuff_chance_neg1Increases the chance of curses from fights by %1%gof_effect_keys_pos/Increases the chance of keys from fights by %1%dot_special_26J"Add an auction house" they said. "For the good of the players" they said.selectSelect
