the<br>musical of the same name."tutorial_text_arena_manageryYour arena got spectators! Improve your arena to gain mighty runes. Sacrifice your progress regularly to progress faster.tutorial_text_toilet÷You can find the arcane toilet key now. Throw precious items in the toilet every day and gain equipment for your companions. Moreover, the more items you throw inside, the better items you are offered in the shops.tutorial_text_blacksmithwWell done! Now you can add sockets to your items and increase their attributes. You can also insert gems from the mine.tutorial_text_holy_grailæNow you can find the holy grail in the gem mine of the fortress. It helps you find missing scrapbook stickers by making items you have not collected yet wobble in the hall of fame and shops.tutorial_text_fortress“Congratulations! Now you can begin building your own fortress. Gain gold, XP and gems for your socketed items. In addition, sometimes you‚Äôll find other useful things in the gem mine, for example dungeon keys.tutorial_text_guildßTeaming up with other players in a guild is highly recommended as it has many benefits, for example more gold and XP. Moreover, you can talk to each other in the chat.tutorial_text_achievementpTake a look at the glowing book. It contains all your achievements. Every achievement increases your attributes.tutorial_text_character¿Click the avatar to display your character and level. You can increase your attributes with gold. Moreover, other useful details such as your mount and active potions are displayed there, too.dot_death_5;Always remember: the end is the chance for a new beginning.dot_respawn_79When you died, I thought we would not see you here again.dot_monster_203For every enemy you knock down, two new ones spawn.dot_monster_18+Your sword is a tool that wants to be used.dot_monster_16&A superior tactic would be beneficial.dot_monster_13,It's hard to find a worthy opponent for you.dot_monster_15It may be too late to escape.dot_monster_12FCertainty of death, small chance of success. What are you waiting for?dot_monster_14You've got some work to do.dot_monster_17It's not too late to flee.dot_monster_19Draw your weapon!
dot_misc_1 You feel a curse on these walls.
dot_misc_2#A cold shiver runs down your spine.
dot_misc_4(You feel like you've made a big mistake.
dot_misc_8Your doom lies before you.dot_misc_10There's no way back.dot_misc_12 You hear your own heart beating.dot_misc_15The air smells of death.dot_misc_16You feel you're being watched.dot_misc_17%You feel that you are not alone here.dot_misc_19What you see bodes ill.dot_misc_20The silence is deafening.dot_misc_21You almost tripped.dot_misc_22)You look down, but there's nothing there.dot_misc_23&You feel like you've been here before.dot_misc_28A cold breath of wind hits you.dot_misc_29:Things get better and you take your courage in both hands.
dot_trap_9*Close your eyes and it won't hurt so much.dot_locked_60There's a key for every lock. You just need one.dot_locked_8.This door can't stop you. There's another way.dot_misc_24This labyrinth seems endless.dot_misc_25#Left or right, the choice is yours.dot_misc_26+A map or a compass would come in handy now.dot_misc_30Fear is your sole companion.dot_misc_33 The breath of death touches you.dot_misc_35.Your adventure could end behind the next door.dot_misc_38*Think of the consequences of your actions.dot_misc_39AYou hear something heavy fall to the ground with a muffled sound.dot_misc_40"You feel an oddly powerful energy.dot_misc_44THIS looks interesting.dot_misc_45@There is something there that gives life, takes life or neither.dot_misc_46;In this room a small reward for your great pain awaits you.dot_misc_494If you don't go and see, you might be sorry forever.
dot_trap_1It's a trap!
dot_trap_2>It seems that an extremely mean trapper has made trouble here.
dot_trap_3This mechanism looks painful.
dot_trap_4,A bear trap? There are no bears here at all.
dot_trap_5The trap is ready to spring.
dot_trap_65Will you walk into the trap with your eyes wide open?
dot_trap_7You could trip here.
dot_trap_8This device looks dangerous.dot_trap_101The last one who passed through here is dead now.dot_monster_1You get ready for battle.dot_monster_2"An insane laughter fills the room.dot_monster_3You face your destiny.dot_monster_4You have never felt so alive.dot_monster_5<On your quest for fame and glory a monster gets in your way.dot_monster_6$This monster comes in handy for you.dot_monster_76The monster looks lonely. Introduce it to your weapon.dot_monster_8Redeem this lost soul.dot_monster_9:Many consider the existence of such a being to be a rumor.dot_monster_10/Fight or you won't have anything to tell later.dot_special_1UYou see a well of life in front of you and wonder if you should take a sip or a bath.dot_special_2•This hole leads to where the sun never shines. You fall and it feels like forever. When you hit the ground, your limbs ache and you feel like you've come a long way.dot_special_3]To advance here you have to remove all the stones out of the way. But hey, you can keep them.dot_special_4The floor is lava. Literally.dot_special_5gYou enter the room where the narrator is sitting. He offers you some tea that you can drink or decline.dot_special_6≤In situations like these, it is important to act carefully but without fear because if you don't react quickly enough, you will tempt your fate in a way that will cost your life.dot_special_7 Throw a coin in and make a wish.dot_special_8^When lonely creatures no longer come up with riddles, they like to play rock, paper, scissors.dot_special_9FNow you know where all the items that are thrown in the toilet end up.dot_special_10>The golden light blinds you. There is a mean deceiver at work.dot_special_11GIt smells like old underwear. Are you sure you want to open the locker?dot_special_18>A hoard of gold. Doesn't do much, but it's better than a trap.dot_locked_1$One of the doors seems to be locked.dot_locked_25Without a key you can only continue in one direction.dot_locked_3.You can only get through this door with a key.dot_locked_4+You are too tall to go through the keyhole.dot_locked_5EDo you see a locked door or a free path - that is entirely up to you.dot_locked_71Maybe you should have brought more keys with you.dot_locked_92For every door that closes, a different one opens.dot_locked_10%The door is not jammed. It is locked.dot_blocked_1>What could be so terrible that someone bothered to wall it in?dot_blocked_2)The masonry looks unprofessionally built.dot_blocked_3?Maybe you could uncover a secret passage if you had a bomb now.dot_blocked_4/There could be a shortcut behind this blockage.dot_blocked_55Everything here has still been stonewalled massively.dot_blocked_63What ancient evil might be hidden behind that wall?dot_blocked_78Cold stone and musty gloom block the way into this tomb.dot_blocked_82Someone doesn't want you to take the blocked path.dot_blocked_99Since one path is blocked, the other one could be a trap.
dot_dark_1>You screw up your eyes, but you can't see the slightest thing.
dot_dark_2$Anything could be in this dark room.
dot_dark_30A kingdom for a torch! Or cat eyes. Or whatever.
dot_dark_40Out of the dark a cold breeze comes towards you.
dot_dark_5ZIn the darkness it does not matter what you look at because you can't see anything anyway.
dot_dark_6?Only the omniscient narrator knows what is lurking in the dark.
dot_dark_7)You wonder what is hidden in the shadows.
dot_dark_89You stare into the darkness and the darkness stares back.
dot_boss_9,Apparently it's not just cannon fodder here.dot_boss_10+This one is somehow bigger than the others.dot_boss_112Defeating this opponent would be a real boss move.dot_boss_124You shout: I've already killed much bigger monsters!dot_low_health_8One more hit and you're dead.dot_respawn_1(Here's a little hint: try not die again.dot_respawn_3@Many adventurers entered this dungeon and few have come back ...dot_next_level_1It looks harder from here.dot_next_level_26A door slams shut behind you. Someone has cut you off.dot_next_level_3OThe corridor collapses behind you and you save your life with a desperate leap.dot_next_level_4DYou have bravely fought your way here, but the horror does not stop.dot_next_level_5DThe deeper you go into the dungeon, the more uncomfortable you feel.dot_next_level_6.You feel like there is still a long way to go.dot_next_level_75That was just a mini boss. The world is still doomed.dot_next_level_89You stumble down the stairs and look around in amazement.dot_low_health_1*Done is done, no one will ask "How" later.dot_low_health_2*You're trying to make it extra exciting...dot_low_health_6You're about to bite the dust.dot_low_health_3Better close than deadly dose.dot_low_health_4
That hurt!dot_low_health_5'You can feel your pulse getting weaker.dot_low_health_7#From now on you have to be careful.dot_low_health_9I think you're bleeding.dot_low_health_10"The vultures are already wheeling.dot_low_health_11Your heart is racing...for now.dot_low_health_12It was nice having met you.dot_death_1Evil was victorious today.dot_death_2%This place does not forgive weakness.dot_death_30"To be or not to be"? The answer is "not to be".dot_death_4IYou haven't failed. You just found one of the many ways that do not work.dot_death_68You may have to fight a battle more than once to win it.dot_death_7*What kills you does not make you stronger.dot_death_80There was never much hope, but it has faded now.dot_death_9NThe winner writes history. But this time it's not you but the heroic monsters.dot_death_101It's the taking part that counts. But you're out.dot_respawn_29You feel like you've been here before. Is this d√©j√† vu?dot_respawn_4:You've risen like a phoenix from the ashes in the dungeon.dot_respawn_5fSometimes you have to take the wrong path first to find the right one. Maybe you'll make it this time.dot_respawn_6LTo achieve the possible, the impossible has to be attempted again and again.dot_respawn_8You enter the dungeon. Again.dot_respawn_9*This dungeon is too nice not to try again.dot_respawn_10)You enter this creepy dungeon once again.guild_pet_requirementsrA level 150+ guild leader can select a<br>level 100+ pet as guild pet if the guild has<br>a minimum of 10 members.)error_enemy_does_not_have_a_fortress_text:There are currently no enemies available. Try again later.town_popup_portalu<white>Portal</white><br>Once again you are too late,<br>please leave through the castle gate.<br>Under construction!health_bear_mask_bonus(<br><green>+ 25% bear mask bonus</green>daily_quest_description_18'Fight in the dungeon or pet habitat %1xsupport_textæThe <link:manual>manual</link> helps you learn the game.<br><br>Get help in the <l