Goblin Pitunderworld_building_name_04Soul Extractorunderworld_building_name_03Gold Pitunderworld_building_name_02Underworld Gateunderworld_building_name_01Heart of Darkness"underworld_building_description_10!Invading heroes fear it the most."underworld_building_description_087Trolls are effective defenders against invading heroes."underworld_building_description_07[The Gladiator trains your character, companions and pets to boost your critical hit damage."underworld_building_description_06ÇThe upgrade level of the Torture Chamber increases the amount of Souls you can reap from invading heroes by 10% per upgrade level."underworld_building_description_054Goblins form the first line against invading heroes."underworld_building_description_01oThe Heart of Darkness is the main building in the Underworld. It determines the other buildings' maximum level.tv_permission_titleTubetv_off	Tube off!tutorial_witch_step_7_title	The witchtutorial_witch_step_7_text†The witch offers spell scrolls once the whole game world has gathered enough items. You can buy completed scrolls in the magic shop and enchant your items with.!tutorial_weapon_shop_step_4_titleEquip yourself tutorial_weapon_shop_step_4_textµGet a full set of armor and a good weapon as soon as possible. Pay attention to the attributes.<br><br>The shops are refreshed once a day. Make sure to renew your potions regularly.tutorial_town_step_1_titleWelcome!tutorial_town_step_1_textõMy name is Shakes. You look like in need of some hints...<br><br>Let's go to the tavern. Select it in the left-hand menu or click the building in the city.tutorial_tower_step_10_title	The towertutorial_tower_step_10_textõTime for fairy tales! The tower has 100 floors but you have 3 companions. Equip them and level them up. Clear a floor to gain loot and a gold bonus of +1%!tutorial_tavern_step_5_title
Good luck!tutorial_tavern_step_5_textçI see you are doing fine. Enter the stable and get a mount to travel faster. There's more to see but you'll find out for yourself. Good luck!tutorial_tavern_step_2_titleReady for adventurestutorial_questing_step_3_titleOn the roadtutorial_questing_step_3_textóDuring a quest you can buy items in the weapon and in the magic shop. Better items help you complete more difficult quests and defeat stronger enemies.tutorial_pets_step_12_titlePetstutorial_pets_step_12_texttCongratulations! You can collect pets now! You will find your first pets easily. All others are rare or well-hidden.tutorial_fort_step_9_titleThe fortresstutorial_fort_step_9_text¨Here you can build and upgrade your own fortress to gain XP and gems to improve socketed items with. You will have to fight quite a few battles against other players first.tutorial_dungeons_step_8_titleThe dungeonstutorial_arena_step_6_titleChallenge real playerstutorial_arena_step_6_textéHere you can fight against equal players for gold and honor. All fights are saved in your PM box. Enter the arena daily to gain additional XP.troll_number_and_strength_154 terribly dangerous Trollstroll_number_and_strength_143 terribly dangerous Trollstroll_number_and_strength_133 terrible Trollstroll_number_and_strength_122 Trolls with large armorytroll_number_and_strength_112 Trolls with armorytroll_number_and_strength_102 Trolls with several weaponstroll_number_and_strength_092 grim Trollstroll_number_and_strength_081 Troll with 2 weaponstroll_number_and_strength_071 Troll with heavy armortroll_number_and_strength_061 Troll with armortroll_number_and_strength_051 Troll with nice helmettroll_number_and_strength_041 Troll with halberdtroll_number_and_strength_031 helmeted Troll with hatchettroll_number_and_strength_021 Troll with hatchettroll_number_and_strength_011 relatively common Trolltown_popup_work5<white>City guard</white><br>Somebody has to do it...town_popup_witch<white>Witch</white><br>town_popup_wheel]<white>Dr. Abawuwu's Fortune Apparatus</white><br>I think I'm spinning 'round and 'round¬†...town_popup_weapon_shopî<white>Weapon shop</white><br>Here you can buy newly forged weapons, armor<br>and also befitting outfits for<br>heroes and heroines of high caliber.town_popup_tavernl<white>Tavern</white><br>Enter the tavern to meet<br>quest givers, drunkards and all<br>kinds of scoundrels.town_popup_stables<white>Stable</white><br>Get a reliable mount to<br>travel much faster and<br>you won't be laughed at all the time.town_popup_petsã<white>Pets</white><br>Every child loves to collect<br>colorful eggs, put them in<br>the nest and wait till<br>dangerous battle pets hatch!town_popup_hall_of_fameç<white>Hall of fame</white><br>Cast in stone this list<br>with ranks and names of<br>all heroes is updated by dwarven clerks<br>all the time.town_popup_guild<white>Guild</white><br>Together you are stronger -<br>a hero should be a member<br>in a partly honorable<br>(or wicked) guild.town_popup_fort5<white>Fortress</white><br>Build as much as you like!town_popup_floating_gemst<white>Floating crystals</white><br>The floating crystals<br>have a very important<br>meaning for you and your life.town_popup_dungeonsc<white>Dungeons</white><br>Enter all those dark dungeons<br>your parents have always warned you of.town_popup_dealerõ<white>Mushroom dealer</white><br>Perfectly disguised under a giant<br>mushroom-shaped tree the mysterious<br>mushroom dealer is waiting for his customers.town_popup_characterÄ<white>Character</white><br>Heroism is a question of your character.<br>Even more important:<br>your equipment and bare figures.town_popup_blacksmith[<white>Blacksmith</white><br>The blacksmith lets you<br>improve items or<br>dismantle them.town_popup_arenaé<white>Arena</white><br>If you are not brave enough to<br>start life-threatening fights for<br>some gold and honor you are<br>not a true hero.town_email_validation_link#Please validate your email address!tower_levelup_text%%1<br><br>Would you like to continue?tower_goto_3	Kunigundetower_goto_2Marktower_goto_1Berttower_enterEnter the Towertower	The Towertouch_friendly_world_selectorb<grey>Game world: %1</grey><br><select_other_world>Select other game world...</select_other_world>*touch_friendly_world_selection_popup_titleSelect worldtotalTotaltoo_many_recipientsToo many recipients!toilet_tank_hint∂The mana tank is filled with<br>each item you sacrifice to<br>the gods in the arcane toilet.<br><br>Once the tank is full you<br>may flush the toilet.<br><br>Fill level:  %1/%2 (%3%)toilet_still_locked_titleToilettoilet_still_locked_textûAh, the toilet. It's been quite silent here recently because somebody lost the damned key...how annoying is that.<br><br>This special location is said to have a magic effect. However, such a locked toilet door has already been a problem for many strapping and heavily armed adventurers.toilet_lid_hint∞The toilet lid shows the current level<br>of your Arcane Aura.<br><br>According to legend, Arcane Aura<br>helps impressing stubborn merchants so they<br>offer you better items.toilet_chain_hint|Pull this chain to<br>flush the Arcane Toilet.<br><br>Each use creates a<br>new item and also increases<br>your Arcane Aura.toilet_bowl_hintôThrow an item into the<br>Arcane Toilet to sacrifice it to the gods.<br><br>You can only do this once per day.<br><br>The fill level of your mana tank increases with<br>each sacrifice. Once the tank is full<br>you can flush the toilet.<br>The gods will thank you and<br>reward you!toilet_auraAura:todo_list_title
