_already_used_text†There's already a character on this server that is connected to your Steam account.<br><br>Would you like to import existing characters from your Steam account?*signup_error_speedserver_is_finished_titleSignup not possible+signup_error_server_is_not_online_yet_titleGame world not released yet*signup_error_server_is_not_online_yet_text9The selected game world is not open for registration yet.@signup_error_password_does_not_match_security_requierments_titleThe password is not secure?signup_error_password_does_not_match_security_requierments_textChoose a more secure password(signup_error_name_is_not_available_titleName not available.'signup_error_name_is_not_available_text;This name is not available. Please choose a different name.%signup_error_mail_not_available_titleE-mail address rejected$signup_error_mail_not_available_texttThe entered e-mail address was rejected. Another character on this game world may already be linked to this address.9signup_error_google_play_games_profile_already_used_titleCharacter found8signup_error_google_play_games_profile_already_used_text∏There's already a character on this server that is connected to your Google Play Games profile.<br><br>Would you like to import existing characters from your Google Play Games profile?3signup_error_game_center_profile_already_used_titleCharacter found2signup_error_game_center_profile_already_used_text¨There's already a character on this server that is connected to your Game Center profile.<br><br>Would you like to import existing characters from your Game Center profile?0signup_error_facebook_profile_already_used_titleCharacter already exists/signup_error_facebook_profile_already_used_text‚There is already a character in the game world which is connected to your Facebook profile or the e- mail address of your Facebook profile.<br><br>Would you like to try to import existing characters from your Facebook profile?shop_reroll_titleOrder new goodsshop_reroll_textReally order new goods?shell_gamer_title_tiny_betWell...!shell_gamer_title_place_bet_firstFine but...shell_gamer_title_medium_betYes!shell_gamer_title_huge_betOh!shell_gamer_title_game_wonCongratulations!shell_gamer_title_game_startGet started!shell_gamer_title_game_lostWhat a pity!shell_gamer_title_choose_nowIt's your turn!shell_gamer_title_bad_mushroomsThere is this small problem...shell_gamer_titleWelcome!shell_gamer_text_tiny_bet4"Gambling for peanuts? You won't win much that way!" shell_gamer_text_place_bet_first$"Place your bet before we can play!"shell_gamer_text_medium_bet;"Wanna win? Then go risk something...very sensible of you!"shell_gamer_text_huge_bet3"Going for the whole hog...how brave. I like that!"shell_gamer_text_game_won="Wow, you are really good at this game. Give it another try!"shell_gamer_text_game_start>"Carefully watch the cups. Following the ball is really easy."shell_gamer_text_game_lostO"Oh, bad luck, what a pity. Another game, another chance, you'll win for sure!"shell_gamer_text_choose_now]"Under which cup is the ball? I'm sure you've paid close attention. I'm chanceless. Tee-hee."shell_gamer_text_bad_mushroomsP"I cannot accept your mushrooms as you did not buy them from a reliable dealer."shell_gamer_textTYou seem to be pretty bright. Feel like a game of fortu...I mean dexterity? Tee-hee.shadow_world_unlockedShadow<br>world!shadow_dungeon_key_foundNew<br>key!shadow:Click here to<br>toggle between<br>light and shadow world.sendSendsellSellsave_account_titleSave character'save_account_steam_status_not_connectedZ<red>Unfortunately, Steam integration on this device is not available at the moment.</red>#save_account_steam_status_connected6The new character will be saved to your Steam profile.save_account_infoªRegister your account and make it secure. Your character will be permanently saved and cannot get lost anymore!<br><br>Moreover, you can play on other devices and also buy mushrooms from the mushroom dealer.<br><br><info>Hint: register by email and validate your email address to gain 10 <mushroom> for free!</info>3save_account_google_play_games_status_not_connectedeConnect the game with Google Play Games to be able to play on all Android devices without a password!save_account_generic_info%Please fill in all fields to proceed.-save_account_game_center_status_not_connected[Connect the game with Game Center to be able to play on all iOS devices without a password!*save_account_facebook_status_not_connected´<red>The game has not been connected to Facebook yet.</red><br><br>Connect the game to Facebook to play your character on all devices without having to enter the password.&save_account_facebook_status_connected◊<green>The game is connected to Facebook. You can log in with your Facebook account.</green><br><br><grey>The email address used for Facebook is %1. It may not be used for a different character in this world.</grey>save_account	Let's go!!rpc_error_connectivity_lost_titleNo Internet connection rpc_error_connectivity_lost_textûThe action could not be completed due to an Internet connection error.<br><br>To be able to play Shakes & Fidget, make sure you are connected to the Internet.'rpc_error_connectivity_lost_during_polluNo Internet connection found.<br><br>To be able to play Shakes & Fidget, make sure you are connected to the Internet.rewatch_fightShow combatreward_titleReward:rewardLoot:revengeCounterattack!return_to_simplified_signupI'm new here!returnBackrestart_required_titleRestart requiredrestart_required_text4This change requires a restart of the app. Quit now?reset_gambleAgain!resend
