epositquest_title_collect_19The Guruquest_title_collect_18Lack Of Ammunitionquest_title_collect_17The Earth Golemquest_title_collect_16The Corpse Monsterquest_title_collect_15The Butterfly Wingquest_title_collect_14Gnawed Hero's Bonesquest_title_collect_13Fresh Sea Flowersquest_title_collect_12	Patch Dayquest_title_collect_11The Secret Ingredientquest_title_collect_10A Whole Lotta Orequest_title_collect_1The Philatelistquest_text_transport_what_9%We're talking about this litter here.quest_text_transport_what_80Do you see this chest? I will climb into it now.quest_text_transport_what_7+I have quite a handy chest of lead for you.quest_text_transport_what_6!You see this empty chest of gold?quest_text_transport_what_5/Take this totally impractical rubber sword, ok?quest_text_transport_what_4-Take this package full of... uh, socks. Yeah.quest_text_transport_what_3You shall take this old hat.quest_text_transport_what_229This magnificent epic item has to be taken extra care of.quest_text_transport_what_21You see this paint bucket here?quest_text_transport_what_20NYou are allowed to transport this bunch of hair. It's quite an honor actually.quest_text_transport_what_2"You must take this bag of peanuts.quest_text_transport_what_19Take this shrunken head please.quest_text_transport_what_18Take this delicate feather.quest_text_transport_what_17,Do you see these rusty greaves? Creepy, huh?quest_text_transport_what_16*Take this bag of flour. It's pretty heavy.quest_text_transport_what_15]I have a computer game rated M for Mature. If you are old enough, this assignment is for you.quest_text_transport_what_144This sheep has to go! That's why you must escort it.quest_text_transport_what_13DLook, what a pretty cow! You have to carry it because it can't walk.quest_text_transport_what_125Carry this pig through the village for me, would you?quest_text_transport_what_11 Take this set of new cartwheels.quest_text_transport_what_10#Take my priceless stamp collection.quest_text_transport_what_1You see this bucket?!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_9$I hope you don't mind heavy lifting.!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_8CAnd don't let the goods drop to the ground. If you snooze you lose!!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_7And no time for coffee breaks!!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_6BAnd no whining. What doesn't kill you will only make you stronger.!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_5!And always remember to buckle up!!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_4#And remember: Lonely are the brave!!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_3AI'll be watching you, every breath you take, every step you make.!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_2$And don't lose anything on your way!"quest_text_transport_pre_closer_103Shouldn't be a problem for a hotshot like yourself.!quest_text_transport_pre_closer_19And make sure that the goods arrive in perfect condition!quest_text_transport_location_9)Carry it to <white>Tusk Mountain</white>.quest_text_transport_location_8.Deliver it to <white>Flooded Caldwell</white>.quest_text_transport_location_70Take it to the <white>Black Water Swamp</white>.quest_text_transport_location_6,Transport it to <white>Split Canyon</white>.quest_text_transport_location_5/Bring it to <white>Shadowrock Mountain</white>.quest_text_transport_location_4.Carry it to the <white>Stumble Steppe</white>.quest_text_transport_location_3.Deliver it to <white>Evernight Forest</white>. quest_text_transport_location_210Transport it to the <white>Rotten Lands</white>. quest_text_transport_location_201Bring it to the <white>Plains of Oz'Korr</white>.quest_text_transport_location_2'Take it to <white>Skull Island</white>. quest_text_transport_location_19$Carry it to <white>Maerwynn</white>. quest_text_transport_location_18.Deliver it to the <white>Black Forest</white>. quest_text_transport_location_17$Take it to <white>Northrunt</white>. quest_text_transport_location_16)Transport it to <white>Gnarogrim</white>. quest_text_transport_location_15.Bring it to the <white>Sunburn Desert</white>. quest_text_transport_location_14$Carry it to <white>Magmaron</white>. quest_text_transport_location_13'Deliver it to <white>Erogenion</white>. quest_text_transport_location_12+Take it to the <white>Busted Lands</white>. quest_text_transport_location_11)Transport it to <white>Nevermoor</white>. quest_text_transport_location_10(Bring it to <white>Moldy Forest</white>.quest_text_transport_location_14Transport it to the <white>Sprawling Jungle</white>.quest_text_scout_second_task_9+Find out whatever you can and return to me.quest_text_scout_second_task_8(Find out what's true about these rumors.quest_text_scout_second_task_7AWho would be brave enough to go there? The answer might be 'you'!quest_text_scout_second_task_6+I need someone stupid who will investigate.quest_text_scout_second_task_5MI should inspect this personally, but I would feel better if you could do it.quest_text_scout_second_task_4>If the rumors are true, I want everything in writing from you.quest_text_scout_second_task_3:I want you to take a close look and draw a picture for me.quest_text_scout_second_task_2 Go there and look at everything.quest_text_scout_second_task_10)What do you think? Might be worth a look.quest_text_scout_second_task_1So look around and take notes.quest_text_scout_first_task_94Rumor has it that a monster lives in a closet there.quest_text_scout_first_task_8[The mysterious castle that only appears for one day every 500 years was spotted, yesterday.quest_text_scout_first_task_7TThere should be a magic circle. Whoever finds the circle may keep one of the stones.quest_text_scout_first_task_6\There might be absolutely nothing. Legend says that it's the most boring place in the world.quest_text_scout_first_task_51Maybe there is something... anything... whatever.quest_text_scout_first_task_4qThere shall be a big stone leading to an ancient treasure - or was it an ancient stone leading to a big treasure?quest_text_scout_first_task_3:It is said that everyone who looks around this place dies.quest_text_scout_first_task_20bI have been told that the legendary Egg of Kadosh is hidden there. It's said to be huge and heavy.quest_text_scout_first_task_2yRumors say that Erik the Shoemaker is held there. As I cannot live without good footwear, this is really important to me.quest_text_scout_first_task_19eThe dwarves have hidden a gem there that is as big as a fist. Or at least the size of a dwarven fist.quest_text_scout_first_task_18bMy spies told me that a goblin placed a huge load of dynamite there that could blow up any minute.quest_text_scout_first_task_17cThat is the place where an old elf lost his legs. Maybe they are still there and you can find them.quest_text_scout_first_task_16'They have the best wine in these lands.quest_text_scout_first_task_15LThere could be a meadow full of magic herbage. But it's probably only weeds.quest_text_scout_first_task_14BThere might be a hidden cave. Anyway, no one really believes this.quest_text_scout_first_task_13:There must be the poor old man. He owes me a lot of money!quest_text_scout_first_task_12]Legend says that there lies a magic ring with which you can see the future after it happened!quest_text_scout_first_task_11yIt is said there is a worthless treasure inside a jeweled golden chest. You can keep the treasure, I only want the chest.quest_text_scout_first_task_10oPeople say that there is a demon portal. But nobody knows more, because everybody who's gone there is dead now.quest_text_scout_first_task_1dIt is said that there is an underground fountain. This may sound interesting, but actually it's not.quest_text_opener_9'Do you have the time for a great quest?quest_text_opener_8.Hey buddy, you arrived at just the right time.quest_text_opener_7DWelcome! Welcome! I have a great quest that is waiting just for you!quest_text_opener_6BYou look like someone who would do anything for a few gold pieces.quest_text_opener_5%Hey you goofball - do you need a job?quest_text_opener_4You again? Okay, here we go.quest_text_opener_31If you have nothing better to do, listen to this.quest_text_opener_2Hey you, listen to me!quest_text_opener_10-I have a little gold, you have a little time!quest_text_opener_1Hey, psst! Yes, you!quest_text_location_9#Climb <white>Tusk Mountain</white>.quest_text_location_8*Travel to <white>Flooded Caldwell</white>.quest_text_location_7+Go to the <white>Black Water Swamp</white>.quest_text_location_6'Run to the <white>Split Canyon</white>.quest_text_location_4(Go to the <white>Stumble Steppe</white>.quest_text_location_3>Prepare yourself to go to the <white>Evernight Forest</white>.quest_text_location_21*Travel to the <white>Rotten Lands</white>.quest_text_location_20/Travel to the <white>Plains of Oz'Korr</white>.quest_text_location_2*Travel to the <white>Skull Island</white>.quest_text_location_19"Travel to <white>Maerwynn</white>.quest_text_location_18(Hike to the <white>Black Forest</white>.quest_text_location_17#Travel to <white>Northrunt</white>.quest_text_location_16,Get on your way to <white>Gnarogrim</white>.quest_text_location_15,Travel to the <white>Sunburn Desert</white>.quest_text_location_14Go to <white>Magmaron</white>.quest_text_location_13#Travel to <white>Erogenion</white>.quest_text_location_12*Travel to the <white>Busted Lands</white>.quest_text_location_11#Travel to <white>Nevermoor</white>.quest_text_location_10*Travel to the <white>Moldy Forest</white>.quest_text_location_1*Go to the <white>Sprawling Jungle</white>.quest_text_kill_pre_closer_9DI would do this myself, of course, but I... uh, I sprained my ankle.quest_text_kill_pre_closer_8>May I ask you kindly to ensure that no more harm will be done?quest_text_kill_pre_closer_7GIt would be totally cool if you could solve this little problem for me.quest_text_kill_pre_closer_6"Turn the beast into a bloody pulp!quest_text_kill_pre_closer_5LDo what must be done. I'll be waiting for your return with milk and cookies.quest_text_kill_pre_closer_4 We need a violent solution here!quest_text_kill_pre_closer_3-Grab your weapon and do what you are best at.quest_text_kill_pre_closer_2%Off you go, and get rid of the beast.quest_text_kill_pre_closer_10?Only you can save us! Only you are a match for this great evil!quest_text_kill_pre_closer_1Go there and slay the beast.quest_text_kill_location_9G<white>Tusk Mountain</white> needs to be freed from a resident monster.quest_text_kill_location_8_<white>Flooded Caldwell</white> has a problem which simply does not want to sink to the bottom.quest_text_kill_location_7`The <white>Black Water Swamp</white>, once a popular spa, is now tormented by a dangerous beast.quest_text_kill_location_6o<white>Split Canyon</white> has become a dangerous place. It is said that an evil creature has taken residency.quest_text_kill_location_5[<white>Shadowrock Mountain</white> is not safe anymore since a sinister creature showed up.quest_text_kill_location_4BA mean creature has been sighted in <white>Stumble Steppe</white>.quest_text_kill_location_36A new menace looms in <white>Evernight Forest</white>.quest_text_kill_location_21KThe <white>Rotten Lands</white> are plagued by a remarkably rotten monster.quest_text_kill_location_20LThe <white>Plains of Oz'Korr</white> have been attacked by an evil creature.quest_text_kill_location_28A horrible creatures stalks <white>Skull Island</white>.quest_text_kill_location_19kI used to go on vacation in <white>Maerwynn</white>, but not anymore since this monster started showing up.quest_text_kill_location_18c<white>Black Forest</white> has always been full of vermin, but the newest addition scares even me.quest_text_kill_location_17QThe residents of <white>Northrunt</white> are scared by something truly terrible.quest_text_kill_location_16KA creature which inhabits <white>Gnarogrim</white> deserves your attention.quest_text_kill_location_15?The <white>Sunburn Desert</white> has a new unwelcome resident.quest_text_kill_location_14B<white>Magmaron's</white> monster worries are getting out of hand.quest_text_kill_location_137<white>Erogenion</white> has an enormous monster issue.quest_text_kill_location_12LAn unwelcome visitor needs to get busted in the <white>Busted Lands</white>.quest_text_kill_location_11CA dangerous beast is roaming the lands of <white>Nevermoor</white>.quest_text_kill_location_10d<white>Moldy Forest</white> is waiting for a hero who wants to go hunting for a mischievous monster.quest_text_kill_location_1BA terrible monster terrorizes the <white>Sprawling Jungle</white>.quest_text_kill_enemy_993I'm talking about an alien from a different planet.quest_text_kill_enemy_98It's a biting alien.quest_text_kill_enemy_97The target is a fire basilisk.quest_text_kill_enemy_96I'm talking about a basilisk.quest_text_kill_enemy_95"I'm talking about a sneaky mugger.quest_text_kill_enemy_94The target is a rowdy robber.quest_text_kill_enemy_93"I'm talking about a smelly bandit.quest_text_kill_enemy_92#It's a sinister creature from hell.quest_text_kill_enemy_91!The target is a nasty hate demon.quest_text_kill_enemy_90(I'm talking about a cruel demon warrior.quest_text_kill_enemy_9#I'm talking about a rattling cobra.quest_text_kill_enemy_89It's a creepy gremlin.quest_text_kill_enemy_88$The target is a mischievous gremlin.quest_text_kill_enemy_87"I'm talking about an evil gremlin.quest_text_kill_enemy_86It's a mean gremlin.quest_text_kill_enemy_85#I'm talking about a biting vampire.quest_text_kill_enemy_84&The target is a blood-thirsty vampire.quest_text_kill_enemy_83%I'm talking about a sinister vampire.quest_text_kill_enemy_82It's a lava blob.quest_text_kill_enemy_81The target is a slimy blob.quest_text_kill_enemy_80It's aggressive quicksand.quest_text_kill_enemy_8It's a frost demon.quest_text_kill_enemy_79The target is a slimy blob.quest_text_kill_enemy_78The target is a grim wolf.quest_text_kill_enemy_77I'm talking about a rabid wolf.quest_text_kill_enemy_76It's an ice wolf.quest_text_kill_enemy_75The target is a biting mutt.quest_text_kill_enemy_74I'm talking about a banshee.quest_text_kill_enemy_73It's a raging centaur.quest_text_kill_enemy_72!The target is a wrathful centaur.quest_text_kill_enemy_71#I'm talking about an angry centaur.quest_text_kill_enemy_70It's a witch.quest_text_kill_enemy_7The target is a firelog.quest_text_kill_enemy_69&The target is an ugly bride from hell.quest_text_kill_enemy_68'I'm talking about a swamp nymphomaniac.quest_text_kill_enemy_67$The target is a terrifying succubus.quest_text_kill_enemy_66The target is a fire scorpion.quest_text_kill_enemy_65$I'm talking about a shadow scorpion.quest_text_kill_enemy_64It's a jungle scorpion.quest_text_kill_enemy_63 The target is a deadly scorpion.quest_text_kill_enemy_62"I'm talking about a mountain lion.quest_text_kill_enemy_61It's a panther.quest_text_kill_enemy_60I'm talking about a tiger.quest_text_kill_enemy_6I'm talking about an undead.quest_text_kill_enemy_59The target is a snow lion.quest_text_kill_enemy_58 I'm talking about a tree spider.quest_text_kill_enemy_57!The target is a terror tarantula.quest_text_kill_enemy_56!I'm talking about a giant spider.quest_text_kill_enemy_55It's a slobbering gnoll.quest_text_kill_enemy_54The target is a winter gnoll.quest_text_kill_enemy_53The target is a gnoll.quest_text_kill_enemy_52 I'm talking about a magma giant.quest_text_kill_enemy_51It's a stone giant.quest_text_kill_enemy_50I'm talking about a taurus.quest_text_kill_enemy_5It's a zombie.quest_text_kill_enemy_49The target is a taurus.quest_text_kill_enemy_48It's a taurus.quest_text_kill_enemy_47The target is a pesky piratequest_text_kill_enemy_46'I'm talking about the scum of the seas.quest_text_kill_enemy_45It's a mean piratequest_text_kill_enemy_44It's a rabid rabbit.quest_text_kill_enemy_43The target is a killer rabbit.quest_text_kill_enemy_42It's a pink killer rabbit.quest_text_kill_enemy_41It's a killer rabbit.quest_text_kill_enemy_40The target is a killer rabbit.quest_text_kill_enemy_4The target is a flesh golem.quest_text_kill_enemy_39The target is a killer rabbit.quest_text_kill_enemy_38The target is a yeti.quest_text_kill_enemy_37I'm talking about a bigfoot.quest_text_kill_enemy_36It's a raptor.quest_text_kill_enemy_35The target is a raptor.quest_text_kill_enemy_34It's a raptor.quest_text_kill_enemy_33The target is a rotten ghoul.quest_text_kill_enemy_32!I'm talking about a smelly ghoul.quest_text_kill_enemy_31"I'm talking about a ghastly ghoul.quest_text_kill_enemy_30?I'm talking about a slimy plant that eats vegans for breakfast.quest_text_kill_enemy_3I'm talking about a dusty bat.quest_text_kill_enemy_29+I'm talking about a neglected potted plant.quest_text_kill_enemy_28The target is a sewer rat.quest_text_kill_enemy_27The target is an albino rat.quest_text_kill_enemy_26I'm talking about a pack rat.quest_text_kill_enemy_25$I'm talking about a culture vulture.quest_text_kill_enemy_24!I'm talking about a gray vulture.quest_text_kill_enemy_23 The target is a brainless troll.quest_text_kill_enemy_22#I'm talking about a mountain troll.quest_text_kill_enemy_21 I'm talking about a night troll.quest_text_kill_enemy_20I'm talking about a snow troll.quest_text_kill_enemy_2It's a bat out of hell.quest_text_kill_enemy_19The target is a gray rex.quest_text_kill_enemy_18The target is a red rex.quest_text_kill_enemy_17The target is a green rex.quest_text_kill_enemy_16%I'm talking about a rabid brown bear.quest_text_kill_enemy_157;There's been talk about a little green man lingering there.quest_text_kill_enemy_155pWhatever the heck kind of critter it is over there, it sure ain't coming from any place that I've ever heard of.quest_text_kill_enemy_1522Some militant lizard is playing with swords there.quest_text_kill_enemy_15#The target is a giant grizzly bear.quest_text_kill_enemy_1480A gigantic dragon keeps spitting hellfire there.quest_text_kill_enemy_145&The culprit is a strange martial monk.quest_text_kill_enemy_14The target is a problem bear.quest_text_kill_enemy_139#Word is, there lives a grey dragon.quest_text_kill_enemy_138)I'm talking about a member of The Family.quest_text_kill_enemy_137It's an octopus.quest_text_kill_enemy_136The target is a cyclops.quest_text_kill_enemy_135!I'm talking about a fire cyclops.quest_text_kill_enemy_134It's a cyclops.quest_text_kill_enemy_133The target is a cyclops.quest_text_kill_enemy_132!I'm talking about a green glompf.quest_text_kill_enemy_131It's a blue glompf.quest_text_kill_enemy_130The target is a red glompf.quest_text_kill_enemy_13The target is a polar bear.quest_text_kill_enemy_129I'm talking about a ghost.quest_text_kill_enemy_128It's a corrupted terror tree.quest_text_kill_enemy_127The target is a terror tree.quest_text_kill_enemy_126"I'm talking about an insect swarm.quest_text_kill_enemy_125It's a sand storm.quest_text_kill_enemy_124The target is a twister.quest_text_kill_enemy_123I'm talking about a wild boar.quest_text_kill_enemy_122It's a wild boar.quest_text_kill_enemy_121The target is a lion.quest_text_kill_enemy_120,I'm talking about an innocent elephant baby.quest_text_kill_enemy_12"I'm talking about a spittle cobra.quest_text_kill_enemy_119It's a gorgon.quest_text_kill_enemy_118The target is a gorgon.quest_text_kill_enemy_1171I'm talking about a terrifying skeletal guardian.quest_text_kill_enemy_116It's a skeletal warrior.quest_text_kill_enemy_115!The target is a skeletal warrior.quest_text_kill_enemy_114"I'm talking about a skeletal mage.quest_text_kill_enemy_113It's a skeletal mage.quest_text_kill_enemy_112It's a skeleton.quest_text_kill_enemy_111%I'm talking about a mountain gorilla.quest_text_kill_enemy_110The target is a gorilla.quest_text_kill_enemy_11It's a nutty natter.quest_text_kill_enemy_109The target is a white gorilla.quest_text_kill_enemy_108"I'm talking about a mud crocodile.quest_text_kill_enemy_107It's a shadow alligator.quest_text_kill_enemy_106 The target is a frost alligator.quest_text_kill_enemy_1052I'm talking about a mean-spirited swamp crocodile.quest_text_kill_enemy_104It's a spongy gargoyle.quest_text_kill_enemy_103!The target is a ghastly gargoyle.quest_text_kill_enemy_102#I'm talking about a fire elemental.quest_text_kill_enemy_101It's a dark rider.quest_text_kill_enemy_100The target is a deadly alien.quest_text_kill_enemy_10The target is a shadow cobra.quest_text_kill_enemy_1The target is a dirty bat.quest_text_fetch_what_99I need two pairs of crocodile eyes. So the total is four.quest_text_fetch_what_8!I want to have a gnawed off bone.quest_text_fetch_what_7VI want to learn the forbidden craft of gold farming; go and fetch me a self-help book.quest_text_fetch_what_6<I need a fireball, still shrink wrapped in its original box.quest_text_fetch_what_5FI want this thingy... what's it called... well, you know, that thingy.quest_text_fetch_what_4/I want the most powerful artifact in the world!quest_text_fetch_what_3.I need a large wooden sword. Don't ask me why.quest_text_fetch_what_20&I am looking for a mysterious crystal.quest_text_fetch_what_2*I want you to fetch a new lollipop for me.quest_text_fetch_what_194What am I doing here? This game needs a proper plot.quest_text_fetch_what_18'I am searching for the meaning of life.quest_text_fetch_what_17<I am looking for a stylish cloak that can make me invisible.quest_text_fetch_what_161I need a golden suit of armor made out of copper.quest_text_fetch_what_155I need a magical sword with all sorts of superpowers.quest_text_fetch_what_14I am looking for a holy shield.quest_text_fetch_what_131I need something that is beyond your imagination.quest_text_fetch_what_12I want to be a millionaire!quest_text_fetch_what_112I need deodorant, stick or gel, it doesn't matter.quest_text_fetch_what_10 I really need a beta key... bad.quest_text_fetch_what_11I dropped my fruit drops and now I need new ones.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_9EYou can keep one of the eyes. Technically speaking I only need three.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_8.The thought of that bone makes my mouth water.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_7?Just don't tell anyone or you will get us banned in an instant.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_6CMake sure that the fireball is still hot and nicely gift-wrapped...quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_51Hurry up! You know that I cannot live without it!quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_4.And it's no big deal if things don't work out.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_3IDon't disappoint me! The sword needs to be really big and totally wooden!quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_20>Just don't look into the crystal or strange things may happen.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_21And make haste, or I won't have anything to lick!quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_199Just don't return before you have plotted something nice.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_18Remember everything people tell you on your travels, use your knowledge to found a new religion and come back to evangelize me.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_17AOnce I have the cape I can hide and won't have to pay you. He-he!quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_16cJust make sure that the armor is gold plated, but not made out of massive gold. It could get heavy.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_15iThe more magic power the better. And if you don't bring me the sword, I'll use it to cast a spell on you!quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_14YI've always wanted such a shield. It's supposed to be cheating, but we won't tell anyone.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_13ZI could explain to you what this is all about, but the whole thing doesn't make any sense.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_12-And you will get nothing! Not a single penny!quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_11bBetter be successful or I will keep smelling like this! I just don't have the time to take a bath.quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_101And don't you dare go using the key for yourself!quest_text_fetch_pre_closer_1DThen hurry up, and return as fast as you can. I need my fruit drops!quest_text_fetch_from_9DThere you will meet an old monk, who will not be helpful in any way.quest_text_fetch_from_8?Perform the ancient rain dance and it will fall from the skies.quest_text_fetch_from_7@You shall find it in the old well (if there is any well at all).quest_text_fetch_from_6=There you will meet my contact - she will give you the goods.quest_text_fetch_from_5)Slay monsters long enough until it drops.quest_text_fetch_from_4OThere is an old dragon that will help you, unless he decides to kill you first.quest_text_fetch_from_3 You will find it there. Somehow.quest_text_fetch_from_2cThere you will find an innocent little girl. Just steal whatever it is you're looking for from her.quest_text_fetch_from_15FThere you will meet a person that will tell you how to get back to me.quest_text_fetch_from_14SYou will search there without finding anything and end up feeling pretty exhausted.quest_text_fetch_from_13GI have hidden it there somewhere. But I am not going to tell you where!quest_text_fetch_from_12'From this point on you are on your own.quest_text_fetch_from_115Unfortunately I'm clueless about any further details.quest_text_fetch_from_10FThis is where my mother lives. Bring her flowers and she may help you.quest_text_fetch_from_1PThere you will meet a guy with dreadlocks. He will give you the hot merchandise.quest_text_escort_whom_8$There's that veteran veterinarian...quest_text_escort_whom_7You know the veiled veil, eh?quest_text_escort_whom_69You will be accompanied by the slave of the slave trader.quest_text_escort_whom_52The insolvent merchant is completely broke by now.quest_text_escort_whom_4,Your duty is to accompany the noble old man.quest_text_escort_whom_33Your assignment's about the daughter of the mother.quest_text_escort_whom_23I'm sure you've heared of IT!quest_text_escort_whom_22.The village idiot can't travel anywhere alone.quest_text_escort_whom_21$The eleventh elf needs some company.quest_text_escort_whom_20)I have caught a monster with eleven eyes.quest_text_escort_whom_2DSee this old man here? He has nothing to eat and holes in his socks.quest_text_escort_whom_191What a cute dragon whelp! Take care of it for me.quest_text_escort_whom_18 Please take care of "the thing".quest_text_escort_whom_173There's that naked princess I'm sure you heared of.quest_text_escort_whom_16)You know the man with the mask, I assume?quest_text_escort_whom_151There lives a stunningly beautiful orc near here.quest_text_escort_whom_14%Please take care of the double agent.quest_text_escort_whom_139The subject of your assignment is the priest of the deep.quest_text_escort_whom_12I trust you with my brother.quest_text_escort_whom_11'There's this helpless superhero here...quest_text_escort_whom_10&The half dwarf can be quite a handful.quest_text_escort_whom_1You know the son of the smith?quest_text_escort_pre_closer_90He sometimes loses his hat, so be on your guard!quest_text_escort_pre_closer_8>Just keep him away from animals or he will try to neuter them.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_7DJust don't remove the veil because no-one must see the veil beneath.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_6But don't sell her on the way!quest_text_escort_pre_closer_54Just don't get involved in any shady deals with him.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_4FAnd come up with some interesting conversation topics for the journey.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_3/And just to make myself clear: Don't touch her!quest_text_escort_pre_closer_23]IT! will follow you until you reach your destination - and maybe for the rest of your life...quest_text_escort_pre_closer_22JKeep him on a short leash. He is afraid of butterflies and might run away.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_21<And make sure that he survives or you will not get a reward.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_20"And sing him a lullaby at bedtime.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_2;And make sure that he is well and alive when you get there.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_19%But beware! He likes to breathe fire.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_18rYes, the thing... I mean who reads these descriptions anyway? Just pick the quest which gives you the best reward.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_17GBy the way, she is quite ugly, so you better grab some clothes for her.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_167And don't tell him that he carries his mask inside out.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_15:Just don't look in his eyes - he doesn't like that at all.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_14IQuite honestly, I am not exactly sure if he is working for or against us.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_131He is not that important, so you may spit on him.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_12+And don't tease him as much as I always do.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_116Always be aware of his supremacy and his helplessness.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_10'And don't lose him, he is really small.quest_text_escort_pre_closer_1.This is really important, so don't mess it up.quest_text_escort_location_98You shall reach <white>Tusk Mountain</white> by sundown.quest_text_escort_location_83You must travel to <white>Flooded Caldwell</white>.quest_text_escort_location_79Your destination is the <white>Black Water Swamp</white>.quest_text_escort_location_61You shall both go to <white>Split Canyon</white>.quest_text_escort_location_54Ride together to <white>Shadowrock Mountain</white>.quest_text_escort_location_4,Travel to the <white>Stumble Steppe</white>.quest_text_escort_location_3BThe subject must safely reach the <white>Evernight Forest</white>.quest_text_escort_location_21AThe travel will lead you both to the <white>Rotten Lands</white>.quest_text_escort_location_20HYou shall escort your protectee to the <white>Plains of Oz'Korr</white>.quest_text_escort_location_25Escort your protectee to <white>Skull Island</white>.quest_text_escort_location_192Please travel to <white>Maerwynn</white> together.quest_text_escort_location_183I need you both at the <white>Black Forest</white>.quest_text_escort_location_175Get the subject to <white>Northrunt</white> - safely.quest_text_escort_location_16/Escort the subject to <white>Gnarogrim</white>.quest_text_escort_location_158Escort the subject to the <white>Sunburn Desert</white>.quest_text_escort_location_14+Travel together to <white>Magmaron</white>.quest_text_escort_location_136You shall reach <white>Erogenion</white> in good time.quest_text_escort_location_122You must head for the <white>Busted Lands</white>.quest_text_escort_location_11.Head to <white>Nevermoor</white>, both of you!quest_text_escort_location_109I need you both to travel to <white>Moldy Forest</white>.quest_text_escort_location_17Travel together to the <white>Sprawling Jungle</white>.quest_text_collect_what_9QI am looking for potent herbs. I don't care what kind, as long as they're potent!quest_text_collect_what_8)I'm looking for the unique Amulet of Kor.quest_text_collect_what_77I'm looking for the latest trends. Collect some for me.quest_text_collect_what_66I need gold bars! Doesn't matter what they're made of!quest_text_collect_what_5)I need a few more barrels with resources.quest_text_collect_what_44I collect empty threats, but some are still missing.quest_text_collect_what_3>I collect trash and other old things that might be recyclable.quest_text_collect_what_20bMe and my people want to rage war, but we need some clever attack plans - go and find some for me.quest_text_collect_what_25I need somebody to collect returnable bottles for me.quest_text_collect_what_198I want to start a cult and need a few fanatic followers.quest_text_collect_what_18_I've tried to shoot you with my bow but keep missing. Now I am out of arrows and need new ones.quest_text_collect_what_177I want to create a golem and need a bucket full of mud.quest_text_collect_what_16=I need a few more corpses for my super-deadly corpse monster.quest_text_collect_what_15ZYou look like someone who can deal with butterflies. Go and fetch me some butterfly wings.quest_text_collect_what_14II need the bones of a fallen hero. Someone just like you, only more dead.quest_text_collect_what_13\I need sea flowers for a mighty spell. I know that they don't exist, but I need them anyway.quest_text_collect_what_12^Somebody must look for new eye patches. I can't find my old ones and patch day is coming soon.quest_text_collect_what_11mI need an experienced hero to bring me the secret ingredient. I want to do some cooking and I like surprises.quest_text_collect_what_10EA friend of mine needs plenty of ore. He wants to be totally oresome.quest_text_collect_what_1)I need somebody to collect stamps for me.quest_text_collect_amount_9&Just bring me as many as you can find.quest_text_collect_amount_8FYou should find it there. I guess one will be enough, don't you think?quest_text_collect_amount_71Gather a minimum of %1 there and come back to me.quest_text_collect_amount_6.Get a minimum of %1 there and come back to me.quest_text_collect_amount_51Gather a minimum of %1 there and come back to me.quest_text_collect_amount_4.Get a minimum of %1 there and come back to me.quest_text_collect_amount_31Gather a minimum of %1 there and come back to me.quest_text_collect_amount_21Gather a minimum of %1 there and come back to me.quest_text_collect_amount_12pJust collect stuff until the quest is finished. And always pay close attention to what the quest is telling you.quest_text_collect_amount_11VFetch me all that you can find there. Then resume collecting in the rest of the world.quest_text_collect_amount_10UDon't stop collecting until your backpack is full. Then dump it and start over again.quest_text_collect_amount_11Gather a minimum of %1 there and come back to me.quest_text_closer_9)Don't forget: Bad news is never rewarded!quest_text_closer_8*Don't forget: Good news is always welcome!quest_text_closer_7!Do you think you can handle this?quest_text_closer_6
Stay cool!quest_text_closer_5Get yourself moving!quest_text_closer_4Got it?quest_text_closer_3Does this make sense to you?quest_text_closer_2Are you in?quest_text_closer_17,And while you're at it, get me some cookies!quest_text_closer_16At least you could try it.quest_text_closer_15I think you can do it.quest_text_closer_14Any questions?quest_text_closer_13If you do it, do it with style!quest_text_closer_12
All clear?quest_text_closer_11And now - let's dance!quest_text_closer_10Are you gonna do it or not?quest_text_closer_1Did you get that?"quest_offer_gold_bonus_popup_tower<br><tab:10>%1% for tower"quest_offer_gold_bonus_popup_guild$<br><tab:10>%1% for treasure (guild)!quest_offer_exp_bonus_popup_guild&<br><tab:10>%1% for instructor (guild)!quest_offer_exp_bonus_popup_album<br><tab:10>%1% for scrapbookquest_offer_bonus_popup_runes<br><tab:10>%1% for runesquest_giver_title_9Hi you hick!quest_giver_title_8Tee-hee, it's me!quest_giver_title_7Hey you palooka.quest_giver_title_6Enough of words.quest_giver_title_5	Hey, you!quest_giver_title_4Psst!...Yes, you!quest_giver_title_3	Hey, kid!quest_giver_title_2Can you help me?quest_giver_title_10Abra...cada... *hiccup*quest_giver_title_1Grrr...quest_giver_text_9o"I am a mighty Paladin so show some respect! Make yourself useful and lend me a hand. Maybe I will reward you."quest_giver_text_8ó"Nooo, not the evil twin brother! He is the evil one. I am Fedget the benevolent and I have a simple, most certainly not fatal quest for you! Tee-hee!"quest_giver_text_7óI don't think you are brave enough to complete the following quest because you are too clumsy with the bow. Nevermind, I've already finished work. So."quest_giver_text_6z"It's time to fight with the enemy. Or rather against it. Pursue it if it flees. And...destroy it. Just go for it, right?"quest_giver_text_5xAre you familiar with this area? I am looking for an adventurous local for some very specific quests. Are you in for it?quest_giver_text_4Hush, be quiet! I hear that a spy is in the area. Anyway, I've got some super secret missions for you. Maybe you're interested?quest_giver_text_3îWhat are you looking at? Maybe you don't like working for someone looking more dangerous and beautiful than you. If not, take a look at my missions.quest_giver_text_2fI have a lot of problems right now, and I hope you can help me. If not, I'll be in deep, deep trouble.quest_giver_text_10Ö"Hey! Have you seen my pipe? Someone has stolen it sneakily! And as you are about to help me anyway, there's something else to do..."quest_giver_text_1ëI hope you have balls, as my quests are not designed for weaklings. Take a look at what I have to offer, but if you are afraid then just go away.push_title_work_finishedCity guard finished$push_title_underworld_souls_finishedSoul Extractor full#push_title_underworld_gold_finishedGold Pit full'push_title_underworld_building_finishedBuilding finishedpush_title_quest_finishedQuest finished!push_title_fortress_wood_finishedWoodcutter's Hut full"push_title_fortress_units_finishedTraining units finished"push_title_fortress_stone_finishedQuarry full%push_title_fortress_gemstone_finished	Gem found%push_title_fortress_building_finishedBuilding finishedpush_text_work_finished*Your work as city guard has been finished.#push_text_underworld_souls_finished,New souls from the Soul Extractor are ready."push_text_underworld_gold_finished$New gold from the Gold Pit is ready.&push_text_underworld_building_finished(An underworld building has been finishedpush_text_quest_finishedYour quest has been finished. push_text_fortress_wood_finished%1 wood ready.!push_text_fortress_units_finished(The training of units has been finished.!push_text_fortress_stone_finished%1 stones ready.$push_text_fortress_gemstone_finishedYou have found a gem.$push_text_fortress_building_finished&A fortress building has been finished.purge_inbox_popupß<white>Capacity of your inbox</white><br><grey>If your inbox is full<br>no more messages will<br>be delivered.</grey><br><br>Click here to delete your<br>entire inbox.purge_inbox_confirmation_titleDelete entire inboxpurge_inbox_confirmation_textØAttention! You have %1 message(s) in your inbox.<br><br>Are you sure you want to empty your inbox?<br><br><red>If you continue all messages will be irreversibly deleted!</red>promotion_mount_duration<br>Active f