spite the misleading nickname...monster_name_478YPied Piper|Horrible beasts that want to dance to his piping...it shall become their doom!monster_name_477oSigi Musclehead|He wanted to be a dragon slayer, but didn't make the cut. So he became Mister Universe instead.monster_name_476,King Arthur|Time to dispose of the monarchy.monster_name_475íBrother Barfly|No one can keep up with him when it comes to drinking the communion wine. But perhaps you've got some other tricks up your sleeves.monster_name_474iParsifal|With that giant skewer, he's probably on the hunt for the holy grill. Time to barbecue the hick!monster_name_473$Friendly Snowman|Hungry for carrots?monster_name_472íRed&White Forever|After Fairy Tale Forest was cut down, the sisters set themselves up as soccer club mascots and ketchup and mayonnaise promoters.monster_name_471PFearless Wanderer|He's obviously never played Slender... And he's never met you.monster_name_470WBeautiful Princess|You'll have to perform miracles if you rogues want to impress her...monster_name_468ïB. O. Wolf|A former legend who now mainly fights people who make terrible films about him. That's understandable, but unfortunately, he's in the way.monster_name_467ÄPrince Charming|That shamefully suave charmer will try and sweet talk his way out of it. The question is, will you fall for it? monster_name_466éAquirella the Dazzler|She knows how to use those two shells. Many seafarers have been so entranced that they've sailed straight onto the reef.monster_name_465dThorny Lion|He's probably quite nice, but that excuse won't fly with you. Just be glad he's wounded!monster_name_464wRobber Hopsenplops|His pepper gun is a joke compared to what you seasoned berserkers snort - the ashes of your enemies!monster_name_462bHulda the Cloud Fairy|Shake your bed for us! Otherwise, we'll have to move on to the pillow fight!monster_name_461qBronycorn|Always on the cutting edge. Friendship is magic! And revenge is salami - because it's best served cold.monster_name_460tThe Enchanting Genie|The blonde woman from the TV show was better. Who wants to wish anything from a tubby blue guy?monster_name_459éCinderella|Talks to animals. Claims she's being bullied at home. Wants to go to the casting show. It's time to put the shoe on the other foot.monster_name_458lMass Fly Murderer|Anyone who swats flies will do the same to adventurers at some point. Better stop him now.monster_name_457åPokerhontas|Didn't she invent the Chicory font and get paid a dollar coin for it? That's gotta be enough. Plus, she's standing in your way! monster_name_456UBear Fear|The intruder breaks in, destroys furniture, and steals food. Show no mercy!monster_name_455åHansel and Gretel|Appetizer: Bread crumbs from the forest floor. Main course: Braised snotty brats. Dessert: Selection of gingerbread cakes.monster_name_454[Dumbo|The glue industry would pay millions for that golden goose. You'd better lend a hand!monster_name_453ÅFreshly Dressed Emperor|Better not tell him that those clothes make him look fat. He's also carrying a new sword on his new belt.monster_name_452kAli the Sesame Opener|The door behind him is blocked by rocks. You'll have to beat the password out of him.monster_name_451aRobin the Redistributor|Upsetting the social balance like that can't be popular with politicians.monster_name_450KPrince in Shepherd's Skin|An ingenious disguise. I hope you see through it!monster_name_449YJulio and Romy|The second most tragic love story ever. That is, if you rework the ending.monster_name_447cBaba Yaga|She emerged from the forest of Molwania and found shelter in the Tower. But not from you!monster_name_446êSimpleminded Chicken Thief|Rumors have sprouted up around his bean growing enterprise. Perhaps he's followed them all the way up into the Tower?monster_name_445LGoose in Luck|If your give her a good thrashing, maybe she'll swap you Hans?monster_name_444KThree Little Pigs|They'll need more than a brick house to be safe from you.monster_name_443dMirrored Fool|He abuses his freedom by mirroring the truth. Can a civil society suffer such a thing?monster_name_442xScarecrow|A preferred method in politics for handing over briefcases of cash. Preventing corruption is a noble endeavor!monster_name_441CJohn or Tom?|...or something like that. Ask a witch, she will know.monster_name_440|Sandman|Anyone who creeps into children's bedrooms at night and throws sand in their eyes has no place in civilized society.monster_name_439öKing Chinbeard|If his beard wasn't so lopsided and if he stopped trying to teach young women manners, it might be possible to have some sympathy for him. monster_name_438iHumpty Dumpty|Sitting pretty on the wall with his grammar book. What would happen if you knocked him off?monster_name_437QUseless Livestock|You can find something better than early retirement everywhere!monster_name_436ùAmnastasia Rubliovka|Who knows exactly where she comes from, but she's always trying to creep into high society circles with the help of dubious accomplices.monster_name_435îPleasure Addict|No excuse to party is too silly for him. He's always celebrating something. Do the right thing and put an end to his endless revels!monster_name_434~Foolish Princess|She should be easy to beat. After all, she falls for any stupid trick. But just make sure she really is dead!monster_name_433eDynamic Peter|He always like he never ages. We see your wrinkles, Peter, and we know your weaknesses!monster_name_432SPenterabbit|Sanctum Peter Cottium, Deus in re unium, hippitus hoppitus reus Domine!monster_name_431ÄAlice in Wonder|Ever since her rabbit ran off she's suffered from delusions. Who knows what she's capable of? Off with her head!monster_name_430xStreet Thief with Monkey|Sniffed his oil lamp too much and now suffers from hallucinations... Put him out of his misery.monster_name_429íDonkey Shot|Called that, or something like that, at least that's how everyone says it. 