er yet. Do you want to found a new one?<br><br>Enter a name for your new guild.found_guildFound 10 <gold>2found_group_error_groupname_is_not_available_titleName not available1found_group_error_groupname_is_not_available_text!This guild name is not available.fort_shield_fullﬁYour fortress has been<br>raided recently. Your<br>resources are<br>temporarily protected from<br>raids of other players.<br><br><white>Protection duration<tab:150>%2</white><br><grey>completely protected<tab:150>%1</grey>fort_resources_label_subscreensD%1<wood> <grey>max. %3</grey><tab:280>%2<stone> <grey>max. %4</grey>fort_resources_labelB%1<wood><tab:150>%2<stone><br><grey>max. %3<tab:150>max. %4</grey>fort_reroll_enemy_newChange opponent$fort_gem_harvesting_not_possible_newD<red>You cannot search for gems while upgrading your gem mine.</red> fort_gem_harvesting_not_possible≤<red>You can't search for gems at the moment because a building is under construction.</red><br><br>You can either build or upgrade a building or search for gems at any one time."fort_error_you_need_level_25_titleLevel too low!fort_error_you_need_level_25_text5You need a minimum level of 25 to build the fortress.fort_error_no_soldiers_titleNo soldiersfort_error_no_soldiers_text[You haven't trained any soldiers. You need at least one soldier to attack another fortress.%fort_error_no_soldiers_selected_titleNo soldiers selected$fort_error_no_soldiers_selected_text$You must choose at least one soldier fort_error_no_free_workers_titleNo workers availablefort_error_no_free_workers_text(All your workers are busy at the moment.'fort_error_need_to_use_more_coins_titleCouldn't skip&fort_error_need_to_use_more_coins_textNUnable to skip because the calculated price wasn't accepted by the game world.fort_error_need_more_wood_titleNot enough wood!fort_error_need_more_wood_textfYou don't have enough wood to start construction.<br><br>You can produce wood at the Woodcutter's Hut. fort_error_need_more_stone_titleNot enough stone!fort_error_need_more_stone_text^You don't have enough stone to start construction.<br><br>You can produce stone at the Quarry.fort_error_need_more_gold_titleNot enough gold!fort_error_need_more_gold_text1You don't have enough gold to start construction. fort_error_need_more_coins_titleNot enough mushrooms!fort_error_need_more_coins_text!You don¬¥t have enough mushrooms!&fort_error_need_higher_building9_titleMages' Tower required%fort_error_need_higher_building9_textgYou must build Mages' Tower, Archery Guild, Barracks, and Fortifications before you can build a Smithy.&fort_error_need_higher_building8_titleBarracks required%fort_error_need_higher_building8_textgYou must build Barracks, Archery Guild, Mages' Tower, and Fortifications before you can build a Smithy.&fort_error_need_higher_building7_titleArchery Guild required%fort_error_need_higher_building7_textgYou must build Archery Guild, Barracks, Mages' Tower, and Fortifications before you can build a Smithy.'fort_error_need_higher_building12_titleFortifications required&fort_error_need_higher_building12_textgYou must build Fortifications, Archery Guild, Barracks, and Mages' Tower before you can build a Smithy.&fort_error_need_higher_building1_titleFortress not upgraded%fort_error_need_higher_building1_textfThe fortress' upgrade level is too low to start this construction.<br><br>Upgrade your fortress first.%fort_error_building_not_in_work_titleConstruction already completed$fort_error_building_not_in_work_textHConstruction couldn't be canceled because it had already been completed.fort_coming_soon_titleFortressfort_coming_soon_textsA new building will be available soon...and much more to come!<br><br>We will announce more in our newsletter soon!fort_building_title%1, level %2fort_building_popup_not_built<grey>Room for<br>%1</grey>fort_building_popup_built<white>%1, level %2</white>fort_building_popup_building=<white>%1</white><br><grey>building under construction</grey>fort_building_not_all_maxed_out-All buildings have to be completely upgraded!fort_building_name_13Gem Minefort_building_name_12Fortificationsfort_building_name_11Smithyfort_building_name_10Treasuryfort_building_name_09Mages' Towerfort_building_name_08Barracksfort_building_name_07Archery Guildfort_building_name_06Academyfort_building_name_05Gem Minefort_building_name_04Quarryfort_building_name_03Woodcutter's Hutfort_building_name_02Laborers' Quartersfort_building_name_01Fortress&fort_building_hindrance_worker_is_busyA construction is in progress!)fort_building_hindrance_not_all_maxed_outUpgrade all buildings first!+fort_building_hindrance_heart_level_too_low$Heart of Darkness level %1 required!'fort_building_hindrance_harvesting_gemsSearch for gems ongoing!*fort_building_hindrance_fort_level_too_lowFortress level %1 required!%fort_building_hindrance_creating_unitUnit training in progress!%fort_building_hindrance_cost_too_highNot enough gold/resources!/fort_building_hindrance_blacksmith_requirementsCBarracks, Archery Guild, Mages' Tower, and Fortifications required!fort_building_description_13+Do you want to search for magical gems now?fort_building_description_12NFortifications provide additional protection against attacks on your fortress.fort_building_description_11@You can increase the level of your combat units with the Smithy.fort_building_description_10FThe Treasury increases backpack space depending on the Treasury level.fort_building_description_09wYou can train battle mages in the Mages' Tower. The maximum number of battle mages equals the building's upgrade level.fort_building_description_08xYou can train soldiers in the Barracks. The maximum number of soldiers is determined by the building's upgrade level *3.fort_building_description_07{You can train archers in the Archery Guild. The maximum number of archers is determined by the building's upgrade level *2.fort_building_description_06ÅYour heroes can earn additional experience at the Academy. The higher the Academy's level, the faster your hero gains experience.fort_building_description_05cSearch the Gem Mine for gems to improve your items. You can find better gems in higher level mines.fort_building_description_02AThe Laborers' Quarters speeds up construction and gem production.fort_building_description_01[The fortress determines the resource capacity and the maximum level of all other buildings.fort_attack_soldiers_labelAttack with %1 (level %2)fort_attack_reroll_cost_labelR<white>Change</white> opponent for<br><white>%2</white><br><grey>Free in %1</grey>fort_attack_reroll_button_popupFree reroll<br>in %1fort_attack_reroll_button_paidNew opponent: 1<mushroom>fort_attack_reroll_button_freeNew opponentfort_attack_player_label_popup	Guild: %1fort_attack_nowAttack now!foreverforeverfolk_name_8Demonsfolk_name_7Goblinsfolk_name_6
Dark elvesfolk_name_5Orcsfolk_name_4Gnomesfolk_name_3Dwarvesfolk_name_2Elvesfolk_name_1Humansfolk_info_8ANo matter where you are - you only hear good things about demons.folk_info_7FGoblins are cheeky, spoiled rascals who hoard a lot of precious stuff.folk_info_69Dark elves have dark intentions and look grim on purpose.folk_info_58Orcs are strong, uneducated and have to face prejudices.folk_info_4>Gnomes are roguish imps who like taking advantage of somebody.folk_info_35Dwarves are hard drinking and have impressive voices.folk_info_2,Elves are good-looking and love fancy woods.folk_info_1=Humans have feeble knees, which they compensate with bravery.folk_button_popup_8—Race: <white>Demon</white><br>Strength<tab:90><green>+ 3</green><br>Dexterity<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Intelligence<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Constitution<tab:90><green>+ 1</green><br>Luck<tab:90><red>- 3</red>folk_button_popup_7“Race: <white>Goblin</white><br>Strength<tab:90><red>- 2</red><br>Dexterity<tab:90><green>+ 2</green><br>Intelligence<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Constitution<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Luck<tab:90><green>+ 1</green>folk_button_popup_6‘Race: <white>Dark Elf</white><br>Strength<tab:90><red>- 2</red><br>Dexterity<tab:90><green>+ 2</green><br>Intelligence<tab:90><green>+ 1</green><br>Constitution<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Luck<tab:90><grey>0</grey>folk_button_popup_5ÀRace: <white>Orc</white><br>Strength<tab:90><green>+ 1</green><br>Dexterity<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Intelligence<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Constitution<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Luck<tab:90><grey>0</grey>folk_button_popup_4—Race: <white>Gnome</white><br>Strength<tab:90><red>- 2</red><br>Dexterity<tab:90><green>+ 3</green><br>Intelligence<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Constitution<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Luck<tab:90><green>+ 1</green>folk_button_popup_3—Race: <white>Dwarf</white><br>Strength<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Dexterity<tab:90><red>- 2</red><br>Intelligence<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Constitution<tab:90><green>+ 2</green><br>Luck<tab:90><green>+ 1</green>folk_button_popup_2ÀRace: <white>Elf</white><br>Strength<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Dexterity<tab:90><green>+ 2</green><br>Intelligence<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Constitution<tab:90><red>- 1</red><br>Luck<tab:90><grey>0</grey>folk_button_popup_1…Race: <white>Human</white><br>Strength<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Dexterity<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Intelligence<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Constitution<tab:90><grey>0</grey><br>Luck<tab:90><grey>0</grey>foldable_menuFoldable menufloating_text_wood_storage_fullStorage<br>full!floating_text_storage_fullStorage<br>full! floating_text_stone_storage_fullStorage<br>full!floating_text_potion_prolonged+3 daysfloating_text_mount_prolonged+14 days#floating_text_life_potion_prolonged+7 daysfloating_text_item_foundItem<br>found!floating_text_gem_foundGem<br>found!floating_text_exp_gathered+%1<br>experience!floating_text_building_upgradedUpgrade<br>completed!"floating_text_building_constructedBuilding<br>completed!(floating_error_you_cannot_sell_from_hereItem<br>equipped!4floating_error_you_can_only_spend_from_your_backpackItem still<br>equipped!#floating_error_valid_email_requiredValid email address required!6floating_error_the_witch_does_not_want_this_item_todayWrong ingredient!$floating_error_target_item_not_foundWrong<br>slot!floating_error_player_not_foundPlayer not found!#floating_error_passwords_dont_matchPassword does not match!!floating_error_password_too_shortPassword too short!"floating_error_no_potion_downgradeSlot<br>used!floating_error_no_more_potions3 potions<br>at a max!&floating_error_no_more_dismantle_todayAgain tomorrow! floating_error_no_backspace_freeNo free backpack<br>slot!floating_error_need_more_metalResource missing!floating_error_need_more_goldNot enough<br>gold!floating_error_need_more_coinsNot enough<br>mushrooms!floating_error_need_more_arcaneResource missing!'floating_error_legal_checkbox_uncheckedPlease read and check!!floating_error_item_has_no_socketCan't be<br>used!floating_error_item_has_no_gemGem missing!(floating_error_item_does_not_belong_hereWrong<br>slot!'floating_error_item_cannot_get_a_socketNot possible.floating_error_group_not_foundGuild not found!floating_error_egg_is_not_readyNot hatched<br>yet!floating_error_drop_item_firstUnequip<br>item!#floating_error_description_too_longDescription too long)floating_error_class_cannot_use_this_itemWrong<br>class!-floating_error_cannot_enchant_empty_item_slotYou need an itemfinishedDone!finish_paidInstantly (%1<mushroom>)finish_hourglassInstantly  (%1<hourglass>)finish_harvesting_paidInstantly %1<mushroom>finish_build_paidInstantly %1<mushroom>finish_arrangementFinished	fill_paid	Fill (%1)fights_todayFights today: %1/%2fights_singular%1 fightfights_plural	%1 fightsfight_strike_evadedEvaded!fight_strike_counterspell	Repelled!fight_strike_blockedBlocked!fight_result_units_defeated%1 and %2 defeatedfight_result_text_type_8_won_80CAs an experienced commander it was easy for you to win this battle.fight_result_text_type_8_won_50=You don¬¥t fear foreign armies - confidently you win the day.fight_result_text_type_8_won_25SThe battle is over and the opposing army is defeated. As large parts of your own...fight_result_text_type_8_won_0DA victory by a hair - just good that your units were more insidious! fight_result_text_type_8_lost_80`Although it was completely hopeless, your units have all fought bravely until the end. Be proud! fight_result_text_type_8_lost_50QThere are battles you just cannot win. Unless you are better than your opponent . fight_result_text_type_8_lost_25<The opponent's army is victorious. And it¬¥s all your fault!fight_result_text_type_8_lost_0YThat was close! With any luck, your army would have won. But unfortunately they had none.fight_result_text_type_7_won_80PThanks to you fear and dismay have found their way into the world of the demons.fight_result_text_type_7_won_50SThere is an endless coming and going at the Demon's Portal. Or something like that.fight_result_text_type_7_won_25WYes, one more demon gone. Is there anything better than improving the world by killing?fight_result_text_type_7_won_0_Demons - job-creation measure for very old guilds? Discuss this topic with leading experts now! fight_result_text_type_7_lost_80\Other guilds have made much better progress and keep failing against much more cruel demons! fight_result_text_type_7_lost_50RYou succeed by scratching, biting and pulling hair unlike others who need weapons. fight_result_text_type_7_lost_25qSoon you will defeat this opponent....next morning when your pain ends your sleep it will be time to strike back!fight_result_text_type_7_lost_0NIf you stay together and show your ruthless brutality you will stand a chance.fight_result_text_type_6_won_80@These cuddly pets are the horrible monsters in a Demon's Portal?fight_result_text_type_6_won_50*This is how you should treat these demons!fight_result_text_type_6_won_25EYou're doing good in the world of demons. Maybe you should move here?fight_result_text_type_6_won_0UWhat a glorious victory! Unfortunately, prophecy says you will fail next time. Oh no. fight_result_text_type_6_lost_80>Your opponent does not look defeated...but at least a scratch. fight_result_text_type_6_lost_50$Go on and you'll be victorious soon. fight_result_text_type_6_lost_250Soon this opponent's existence will be its doom.fight_result_text_type_6_lost_0GOne more hit would have been enough but....you had to become exhausted.fight_result_text_type_5_won_80fOh wow, why do you always have to slaughter poor and innocent fairy tales characters? Good job though.fight_result_text_type_5_won_50SYou faced your childhood fears...and dreams and longings. Now all of them are dead.fight_result_text_type_5_won_25MStupid fantasy creatures who think they are something better. End this drama!fight_result_text_type_5_won_0`Again some memories are lost of a time when your father read fairy tales to you and fell asleep. fight_result_text_type_5_lost_809The good win in the end...but your performance was baaad. fight_result_text_type_5_lost_50s...and so the adventurer and his companions were threwn out of the tower window and were never seen again. The end.fight_result_text_type_5_lost_0?Nibble nibble gnaw and hour, who's nibbling at my little tower?fight_result_text_type_4_won_80VYou mashed this monstrous monster and pushed it off its terrifying throne of twilight.fight_result_text_type_4_won_50fThere were monster hunters who did not smile that much during their deeds...alright, you are the hero.fight_result_text_type_4_won_25hA classic fight, good vs. evil. How nice that you represented the latter side worthily and victoriously.fight_result_text_type_4_won_0-Close fights are always that exciting. *yawn* fight_result_text_type_4_lost_80RThe dungeon inhabitants will tell stories about your weak attempt for a long time. fight_result_text_type_4_lost_50CDon't you think that a hero should win a fight? Or at least try to? fight_result_text_type_4_lost_25GNice. The fight was nice but your opponent wasn't. That's why you lost.fight_result_text_type_4_lost_0TOne more hit would have defeated your opponent but you stopped. It's your own fault!fight_result_text_type_3_won_80…You just won these many fights in darkest nights to stop all rites that evil had in mind. Glory found, monsters slain, soothe your pain with healing rain and raise your sword, mighty lady, mighty lord.fight_result_text_type_3_won_50ZI see you are experienced in defeating invincible hordes of monsters. Don't boast so much!fight_result_text_type_3_won_25GGood job for a guild of your rank. It's ok to be proud of your success.fight_result_text_type_3_won_0TYeah! Your hard work has paid off. Mission complete! Tomorrow's task: the next raid. fight_result_text_type_3_lost_80qWhat a pity. You should only try again in two or three years...when you won't be toddlers anymore...and complete. fight_result_text_type_3_lost_50gNot everything was bad. A little something was not as miserable as the rest of your laughable struggle. fight_result_text_type_3_lost_25GSoon you will master this challenge like a .... challenge master. Yeah!fight_result_text_type_3_lost_0?Your attempt was not successful but it looked nice. Keep it up!fight_result_text_type_2_won_80iYou've given them a piece of your mind...and your axe...and your broad sword...and a death curse...and...fight_result_text_type_2_won_50rWell, there aren't only heroic guilds like your own. There are also guild banner modding clubs like this opponent.fight_result_text_type_2_won_25fThe battle comes to a close with a well-deserved victory. You should reward yourself with some medals!fight_result_text_type_2_won_0GTotally wounded you limp home after this fight. What a triumphant view! fight_result_text_type_2_lost_80UAs we speak, most of your children decide not to touch a weapon in their entire life. fight_result_text_type_2_lost_50yEvery amateur in front of the TV realizes that you were not good enough at running and could not complete crucial passes. fight_result_text_type_2_lost_25KYou should have won this battle, dammit! I placed a high bet on you losers!fight_result_text_type_2_lost_06A bit of bad luck in the end...and a lot of inability. fight_result_text_type_17_won_80sThis Hydra had been acting very headlessly lately. Haha, remember that one. For next time...and later. And later... fight_result_text_type_17_won_50>Now the Hydra has been beheaded once and for all. Case solved. fight_result_text_type_17_won_25FYou beheaded the Hydra one more time. Let's hope it stays like this...fight_result_text_type_17_won_03Hint: Hydra heads can be used for a delicious soup.!fight_result_text_type_17_lost_80*You should have walked your pet elsewhere.!fight_result_text_type_17_lost_50NThere was only one head left. Then the Hydra would have been finally defeated.!fight_result_text_type_17_lost_25]Useless knowledge: a hero who makes pee-pee when seeing a dreadful Hydra is called a Hydrant. fight_result_text_type_17_lost_0DJust because it is invincible does not mean you should not even try. fight_result_text_type_16_won_80EThis self-appointed hero could not stand a chance in your Underworld. fight_result_text_type_16_won_50HThere are more interesting heroes out there that failed your Underworld. fight_result_text_type_16_won_25UThis hero made it far but your deceitful Underworld units were victorious in the end!fight_result_text_type_16_won_0[You gotta be glad such heroes don't get lost in your Underworld that often. That was close!!fight_result_text_type_16_lost_80DYour Underworld is what this hero calls a children's birthday party.!fight_result_text_type_16_lost_50RYou should upgrade the inhabitants of your Underworld. Or look for smaller heroes.!fight_result_text_type_16_lost_25LThis hero was out of your league and your measly cellar you call Underworld. fight_result_text_type_16_lost_0QIn the end one more goblin would have been enough. It might have a day off today. fight_result_text_type_15_won_80eYour opponent would‚Äôve liked to have been able to attack your pets without retribution. Tough luck! fight_result_text_type_15_won_504Your pets prevailed thanks to their awesome tactics. fight_result_text_type_15_won_25_Your opponent was not ready for the immeasurable battle strength of your highly trained beasts!fight_result_text_type_15_won_03Your pets parried this deceitful and sneaky attack!!fight_result_text_type_15_lost_80EWell, your creatures' fighting skills aren‚Äôt any better than yours.!fight_result_text_type_15_lost_50hYou seriously gotta teach your pets how to defend themselves instead of burying their heads in the sand!!fight_result_text_type_15_lost_259Such unmotivated pets don't stand a chance in this world. fight_result_text_type_15_lost_0%Your pets totally failed. How unfair! fight_result_text_type_14_won_80&Your pets left a trail of destruction. fight_result_text_type_14_won_50<Your superbly bred pets‚Äô attack was once again successful! fight_result_text_type_14_won_25SYour mighty pets were victorious against your opponent's shambles of a petting zoo.fight_result_text_type_14_won_0%Your pets defeated your opponent‚Äôs.!fight_result_text_type_14_lost_80,Your pets seem to be having a bad day today.!fight_result_text_type_14_lost_50>How irresponsible! You sent your pets into a pointless battle!!fight_result_text_type_14_lost_25-Your pets fought bravely but without success. fight_result_text_type_14_lost_0QYour pets bit off more than they can chew with this opponent's critters ... Ouch! fight_result_text_type_13_won_806This opponent had no chance against your superior pet. fight_result_text_type_13_won_50bYour pet battled onwards like a berserker. Be careful not to miss anything exploring this habitat! fight_result_text_type_13_won_25CYour pet finally won! This habitat has been explored a little more!fight_result_text_type_13_won_0hYour pet held its ground with effort and hardship. Now you know your opponent and how to steal its eggs!!fight_result_text_type_13_lost_80[Every pet starts small. Fortunately, you can feed it so such a screw-up won't happen again!!fight_result_text_type_13_lost_50DIt didn‚Äôt work. Maybe you should send another pet to this habitat.!fight_result_text_type_13_lost_25WYour pet needs to become a bit stronger before it can progress further in this habitat! fight_result_text_type_13_lost_0;It was close but your pet lost. You‚Äôll succeed next time! fight_result_text_type_12_won_80QYou've brought light into the darkness and relieved the shadow world of a shadow! fight_result_text_type_12_won_50AThe shades of evil are many but none of them matches your skills! fight_result_text_type_12_won_25@You slaughter faster than your shadow. It was close but you won!fight_result_text_type_12_won_0DYou and your companions are extremely exhausted but it was worth it.!fight_result_text_type_12_lost_80BThe shadow world is not for fighters who are afraid of the dark...!fight_result_text_type_12_lost_50*After this fight you are worn to a shadow.!fight_result_text_type_12_lost_25'These things happen. Let's do it again! fight_result_text_type_12_lost_0RThe shadows in him were too strong and he was too lucky. You'll get him next time!fight_result_text_type_1_won_80ÄThis bloody creature is knocked out and the audience is truly impressed by your heroic deed, even if it is only routine for you.fight_result_text_type_1_won_50jYou already fought against a dozen of such pets at once. And you always won! Or let's say not that rarely.fight_result_text_type_1_won_25aThis beast thought it could dominate the world with its evilness and now look at that poor fella.fight_result_text_type_1_won_0IThat was close but a hero must not show fear. Come on, cover your wounds! fight_result_text_type_1_lost_80\How could you overestimate yourself that much, you weakling? Gonna be a nice Internet video. fight_result_text_type_1_lost_50KIt would have made a difference if you had actually showed up for training. fight_result_text_type_1_lost_25^Um, alright...this may happen once in a while, ladies and gentlemen. Look, a one-headed Hydra!fight_result_text_type_1_lost_0WYou crushed the foul beast! It was really thankful and showed you some love right back.fight_result_text_type_0_won_80YAfter this fight you better make sure if there is an actual enemy in the destroyed armor.fight_result_text_type_0_won_50TYour opponent is a known show-off but you have shown him who the boss is. Well done!fight_result_text_type_0_won_25IThis opponent was definitely not harmless but now he got harmed...by you.fight_result_text_type_0_won_0TThat was close but you pulled off some dirty tricks to finally defeat your opponent. fight_result_text_type_0_lost_80SNow you know how it feels when the audience whistles and boos...but they are right. fight_result_text_type_0_lost_50UWhat an impressive show...waving your weapon around, wow! Still you miserably failed. fight_result_text_type_0_lost_25aYou really should have defeated this enemy. Even your little sister is a better fighter than you!fight_result_text_type_0_lost_0hIn the very last second, your opponent is successful with a desperate attack and lands the deciding hit.fight_result_soldiers_sent%1 deployedfight_result_reward_exp%1 XP gainedfight_result_reward_coins%1<mushroom> foundfight_result_rank_lost%1 lostfight_result_rank_gained	%1 gainedfight_result_mages_defeated%1 defeatedfight_result_honor_lost%1 honor lostfight_result_honor_gained%1 honor wonfight_result_gold_lost%1 lostfight_result_gold_gained%1 wonfight_result_archers_defeated%1 defeatedfight_battle_title	%1 vs. %2fight_attribute_line_extreme%1<tab:100>%2fight_attribute_line%1<tab:115>%2	feed_thisFeed creaturefeedFeed ...feature_unlockedUnlocked#facebook_permission_necessary_titlePermission required"facebook_permission_necessary_textIShakes & Fidget only works if all required permissions have been granted.#facebook_error_user_cancelled_titleConnection not possible"facebook_error_user_cancelled_text.Required Facebook login permission not granted"facebook_error_not_supported_titleFacebook not supported!facebook_error_not_supported_text+Facebook is not supported on this platform.+facebook_error_could_not_embed_js_api_titleFacebook not supported*facebook_error_could_not_embed_js_api_text;Facebook is not supported by your browser or it is blocked.*facebook_disconnect_app_confirmation_titleDisconnect game from Facebook.facebook_disconnect_account_confirmation_titleFacebook permission denied$facebook_canvas_create_account_titleWelcome!)facebook_canvas_create_account_name_label(Please choose a name for your character.facebook_app_disconnected_titleGame no longer connectedfacebook_app_disconnected_text-The game has been disconnected from Facebook.#facebook_account_disconnected_titleC