flush the toilet.'error_toilett_has_been_used_today_titleThe arcane gods refuse&error_toilett_has_been_used_today_textNThrowing this item into the toilet would unnecessarily enrage the arcane gods..error_this_pet_is_not_in_your_collection_titleSlot is emptyerror_this_is_not_an_egg_titleAction not possibleerror_this_is_not_an_egg_text/You can only use these slots for eggs and food.*error_the_pet_does_not_like_the_food_titleThe pet does not eat it)error_the_pet_does_not_like_the_food_text+This pet requires a different type of food.error_skill_is_maxed_titleMaximum reachederror_skill_is_maxed_text+You have reached the maximum for that skillerror_sessionid_invalid_titleYour session expirederror_sessionid_invalid_text2Please retry once more, or logout and login again. error_server_not_available_titleServer cannot be reachederror_server_not_available_textOThe server cannot be reached due to server maintenance. Please try again later.$error_server_is_not_online_yet_titleServer is not online yet#error_server_is_not_online_yet_text5The server it not yet online. Please come back later.error_send_pm_text_too_long!Your private message is too long.error_send_pm_player_not_found$Message not sent - player not found!error_send_pm_level_too_lowAYou need to reach level 10 before you can send personal messages!error_sandbox_error_titleInternal errorerror_sandbox_error_text8A problem has occurred while accessing a remote service.error_revenge_message_titleYou can't take revenge.error_revenge_message_text*You can only take revenge once per attack.%error_revenge_message_not_found_titleCounterattack not possible$error_revenge_message_not_found_text3You might have already counterattacked this player.error_revenge_messageYou can't take revenge.error_request_timeout_titleServer cannot be reachederror_request_timeout_textèYour last action could not be completed due to server connection errors.<br><br>Please log in again to make sure your save point is up to date.error_purchase_failed_titlePurchase failederror_player_not_found_titleCharacter not founderror_pet_is_not_hungry_titleAlready fed todayerror_pet_is_maxed_out_titlePet maxed outerror_pet_is_maxed_out_text8Maximum level reached! You cannot feed this pet anymore.)error_password_security_is_outdated_titleNew password required(error_password_security_is_outdated_textãThe password protection for this character is outdated.<br><br>Please <password recovery>reset your password</password recovery> to log in.9error_password_does_not_match_security_requierments_titlePassword too short8error_password_does_not_match_security_requierments_text1Your password must contain at least 5 characters.error_not_24_hours_member_titleMembership too shorterror_not_24_hours_member_textOYou have to be member of this guild for at least 24 hours to use this function.error_no_pass_titlePassword missing!#error_no_pass_text_allow_correctionWNo password found for this character on this device. Please enter the correct password:error_no_pass_textPlease enter your passworderror_no_more_turns_today_titleEnough spinning for today!$error_no_more_free_turns_today_titleNo more spins today#error_no_more_free_turns_today_textSee you tomorrow(error_no_more_dungeon_fights_today_titleFight not possible'error_no_more_dungeon_fights_today_text(No more fights left. Come back tomorrow."error_no_importable_accounts_titleNo characters found!error_no_importable_accounts_text'No characters to import could be found.error_no_guild_chat2Guild chat not available - you are not in a guild!error_no_fruit_titleNo food availableerror_no_fight_found_titleError while savingerror_no_fight_found_text9The last fight could not be saved to the list of battles.#error_no_enemy_fortress_found_titleNo matching opponents available"error_no_enemy_fortress_found_text8No matching opponents available. Please try again later.error_need_to_use_coins_titleYou need to wait longererror_need_more_souls_titleYou need more soulserror_need_more_souls_text#You need more souls for this actionerror_need_more_gold_titleNot enough golderror_need_more_gold_text3You do not have enough gold to complete this actionerror_need_more_coins_titleNot enough mushroomserror_need_more_coins_text^You don't have any mushrooms left. Visit the <dealer>mushroom dealer</dealer> to buy new ones!&error_need_free_slot_starterpack_titleNo empty slot available%error_need_free_slot_starterpack_textƒYou bought a pack with additional bonus content. Please make room in your inventory to receive your bonus.<br><red>You may have to restart the game afterwards in order to receive your bonus!</red>#error_need_free_backpack_slot_titleNo empty slot available."error_need_free_backpack_slot_textäFlushing the toilet will reward you with a magic item.<br><br>You definitely should make room in your inventory before you pull the chain.error_need_a_free_slot_titleBackpack full!error_need_a_free_slot_textrYour backpack is full. You might want to make some room before you proceed, just in case you loot some fancy item!error_name_not_available_titleName not availableerror_name_not_available_text*The name you have chosen is not available."error_must_leave_group_first_titleGuild membership!error_must_leave_group_first_text·You are already member in a guild. Before you can join a different guild you have to leave your current guild first.<br><br>To leave your guild select your name in the list of members and click the red icon above your avatar.error_must_be_valided_titleNot validatederror_messagebox_full_titleInbox full!error_malformed_response_titleInternal errorerror_malformed_response_text$Internal server communication error.error_mail_not_available_titleEmail address not availableerror_mail_not_available_text3Unfortunately, this email address is not available.error_mail_is_illegal_titleEmail address not validerror_mail_is_illegal_textOThe email address you entered is not valid. Please enter a valid email address.)error_items_cannot_be_flushed_twice_titleAlready been there!(error_items_cannot_be_flushed_twice_textmThis item has already gone through the arcane toilet back and forth.<br><br>It cannot take this pain anymore!error_io_error_titleInternet errorerror_io_error_text#Internal server communication errorerror_invalid_token_titleLogin errorerror_group_not_found_titleGuild not found!error_group_not_found_textThe guild could not be found.,error_group_has_no_matching_join_slots_titleYou cannot join this guild+error_group_has_no_matching_join_slots_text1This guild cannot or does not want to invite you.+error_google_play_games_not_connected_titleGoogle Play Games not connected%error_game_center_not_connected_titleGame Center not connectederror_facedata_incorrect_titleClass not available yet!error_facedata_incorrect_textkThe selected class is not available yet on this game world. Please choose another class or try again later."error_facebook_not_connected_titleFacebook not connected!error_facebook_not_connected_textuThe game is not connected to Facebook. Click on the Facebook icon in the top-left corner to establish the connection..error_facebook_canvas_mail_not_available_titleCharacter found-error_facebook_canvas_mail_not_available_text¶There's already a character in world %1 that is registered to your email address used on Facebook.<br><br>Click the game link to connect your character with Facebook!*error_enemy_does_not_have_a_fortress_titleFortress not founderror_egg_is_not_ready_titleEgg not ready to hatch yeterror_egg_is_not_ready_text2You can only open an egg once it's ready to hatch.;error_description_may_not_be_more_then_240_characters_titleCharacter description too long:error_description_may_not_be_more_then_240_characters_text:Your character description must not exceed 240 characters..error_description_change_locked_by_admin_titleCharacter description locked-error_description_change_locked_by_admin_text?Changing the character description has been locked by an admin.error_connectivity_lost_titleNo Internet connectionerror_connectivity_lost_textûThe action could not be completed due to an Internet connection error.<br><br>To be able to play Shakes & Fidget, make sure you are connected to the Internet.#error_connectivity_lost_during_polluNo Internet connection found.<br><br>To be able to play Shakes & Fidget, make sure you are connected to the Internet.error_combat_not_found_titleCombat does not existerror_combat_not_found_text'No Combat has been found for this entryerror_checkin_failed_title"the payment could not be completed-error_cannot_train_units_while_building_titleTraining units not possible,error_cannot_train_units_while_building_text:You can¬¥t train units while upgrading a related building.error_cannot_roll_yet_titleEnough for today!error_cannot_roll_yet_text5You rolled enough dice for today! Come back tomorrow!"error_cannot_join_the_attack_titleJoining not possible!error_cannot_join_the_attack_textYou cannot join this attack.-error_cannot_build_while_training_units_titleYou can¬¥t build this,error_cannot_build_while_training_units_text6You can¬¥t upgrade this building while training units.error_cannot_afford_beer_titleYou can't pay later!error_cannot_afford_beer_textïDon't get me wrong, mate. You do look trustworthy but not more than all the other fellas that hang around here.<br><br>Find a mushroom and come back!#error_adventure_still_running_titleQuest still in progress"error_adventure_still_running_text8Quest still in progress. Even "dark magic" won't help...error_account_not_found_titleCharacter not founderror_account_not_found_text>This character could not be found. It might have been deleted.epic_overlay_popupoToday it's Epic Weekend!<br><br>The chance of finding epic items<br>is higher today - also here in<br>the shop!!enchantment_critical_damage_bonusE<br><attribbonus>+ another %1% for "Sword of Vengeance"</attribbonus>emailEmail addressegg_waiting_hintHatching ...egg_ready_hintReady!egg_hint@<grey>A new pet eventually hatches<br>from every egg!</grey><br>	edit_faceEditduration_labelDuration: %1 dungeonpull_button_hint_no_unitsgIn order to lure heroes into your Underworld<br>you need a building that produces <white>units</white>.dungeonpull_button_hint_no_gate[In order to lure heroes into your Underworld<br>you must build a <white>gate</white> first.#dungeonpull_button_hint_max_per_dayYYou can only lure up to %1 heroes<br>into your Underworld per day.<br>Come back tomorrow!dungeon_unlocked	Unlocked!dungeon_pull_playerIn Underworlddungeon_pull_confirmation_titleLure player into Underworld?dungeon_pull_confirmation_text£Do you want to lure player "%1" (level %2) into your Underworld?<br><br>You'll get the most Souls if the lured hero is at least level %3.<br><br>Lured today: %4/%5dungeon_pullOKdungeon_popup+%1<br><epic quote>%2</epic quote><br><br>%3dungeon_locked_hint6<red>You don't have access to<br>this place yet.</red>6dungeon_error_this_pet_is_not_in_your_collection_titleChoose a pet.5dungeon_error_this_pet_is_not_in_your_collection_text-You must choose a pet to send to the dungeon.#dungeon_error_need_more_coins_titleNot enough mushrooms"dungeon_error_need_more_coins_textÇYou do not have any mushrooms left. Wait a while till you can fight without a mushroom again or get some from the mushroom dealer!"dungeon_error_need_free_slot_titleNo empty inventory slot!!dungeon_error_need_free_slot_text^You might find a precious item...make room in your inventory before you start your next quest.$dungeon_error_need_a_free_slot_titleNo empty inventory slot!#dungeon_error_need_a_free_slot_text^You might find a precious item...make room in your inventory before you start your next quest.+dungeon_error_dungeon_battle_not_free_titleYou need to wait longer!*dungeon_error_dungeon_battle_not_free_text"Please try again in a few seconds.,dungeon_error_cannot_do_this_right_now_titleStill travelling+dungeon_error_cannot_do_this_right_now_text=You cannot enter a dungeon while still working or travelling!#dungeon_error_battle_not_free_titleWaiting time not over yet"dungeon_error_battle_not_free_text"Please try again in a few seconds.dungeon_enemy_title_pets_waterWater habitat, pet %1/20dungeon_enemy_title_pets_shadowShadow habitat, pet %1/20dungeon_enemy_title_pets_lightLight habitat, pet %1/20dungeon_enemy_title_pets_fireFire habitat, pet %1/20dungeon_enemy_title_pets_earthEarth habitat, pet %1/20dungeon_cooldown_noticedAfter your last fight in the dungeon you need to rest (%1)... but you could also consume a mushroom.dungeon_20_titleMount Olympusdungeon_20_comment1The path to the top could become a real marathon.dungeon_19_titleNordic Godsdungeon_18_titleContinuous Loop of Idolsdungeon_17_title
Hemorridordungeon_17_level_20_text]The secret behind his power must be his giant sword! That's why you say "Lord of the Stings".dungeon_17_level_19_textIn your face!dungeon_17_level_18_textHis mount looks really cute.dungeon_17_level_17_text6Finally, a really big, bad and poisonous spider again.dungeon_17_level_16_textThey aren't that dead.dungeon_17_level_15_text,Hopefully, you do not have a peanut allergy.dungeon_17_level_14_text:He has been converted to the Dark Side...oops, wrong film.dungeon_17_level_13_text$Badly counseled means half poisoned.dungeon_17_level_12_text&Because Orcs aren't terrible enough...dungeon_17_level_11_text Horror Demon, how bad can he be?dungeon_17_level_10_textNo swimming.dungeon_17_level_09_textPerhaps Nazgullses-ses?dungeon_17_level_08_text<Rhymes with burnt shoulder, hard as boulder and fire holder.dungeon_17_level_07_textFast and loose!dungeon_17_level_06_text5Beauty is in the eye of the beholder. So is his mace.dungeon_17_level_05_text)Obviously there's a network everywhere...dungeon_17_level_04_textShmy Shrecious!dungeon_17_level_03_text*Among the Goblins the Goblin King is King.dungeon_17_level_02_textPlease do not feed!dungeon_17_level_01_textFWho rides so late across the land so dark?<br>It's an Orc on his Warg.dungeon_17_comment/"Evil dwells on the Ash Mountain of the world."dungeon_16_titleTime-honored School of Magicdungeon_16_level_20_text¢THAT‚ÄôS what happens when an uncle steals your nose as a kid and never gives it back! You really can‚Äôt help but grow up to be the ultimate incarnation of EVIL.dungeon_16_level_19_text'Don‚Äôt worry, this cutie won‚Äôt bite!dungeon_16_level_18_textUNote to self: Give anyone who brags about being ‚Äúpure blood‚Äù a really wide berth.dungeon_16_level_17_textKShe simply loves those Unforgivable Curses. And who wouldn‚Äôt forgive her?dungeon_16_level_16_textQThese days, no respectable dungeon comes without a horde of zombi... uhm, Inferi.dungeon_16_level_15_textpThe personification of a tea party should be perfectly capable of teaching Defense Against the Dark Arts, right?dungeon_16_level_14_textRThis charming, handsome role model must surely be a fine and upstanding character.dungeon_16_level_13_textSHis twin brother is obese and cohabits with a couple of reindeer at the North Pole.dungeon_16_level_12_text`The only thing more dangerous than a powerful cabal of evil super sorcerers is three schoolkids.dungeon_16_level_11_text9What this teacher does to the headmaster shocks everyone!dungeon_16_level_10_textbThere are some subtle visual and etymological clues that this one belongs in the villain category.dungeon_16_level_09_text[I‚Äôm sure a misguided love for animals would never lead him to breed some kind of monster!dungeon_16_level_08_text#Should be easy to steal the clutch.dungeon_16_level_07_textGWho woulda thunk that so much evil can come from a flying bag of bones?dungeon_16_level_06_textôWhen danger‚Äôs afoot, you might want to look the other way! On the other hand... you should be fairly safe if you only look at him in the mirror. Right?dungeon_16_level_05_textoHis heroic deeds could fill volumes. And every single one of his grand stories is based on (alternative) facts!dungeon_16_level_04_text@The only thing he‚Äôs got more of than legs is... offspring¬†...dungeon_16_level_03_text=One dog, three heads ‚Äì and each one snappier than the last!dungeon_16_level_02_textâHis stare is so penetrating you fear he might vilely curse you at any moment. Lucky for you, he doesn‚Äôt have any kind of magic ability.dungeon_16_level_01_textœSomeone must have stuffed this old hat in a pigeonhole where it got crumpled and grumpy. Now it‚Äôs putting you in one, too!<br><br>So, which house shall it be? Grippindoor? Slipperin? Hubblepus? Ravenslawn?dungeon_16_comment!"Accessible from Platform 9 3/4!"dungeon_15_titleTwisterdungeon_15_text„There's thunder, lightning and hail all around you. Suddenly treacherous silence fools you as you find yourself in the eye of the storm!<br><br>Something is coming at you from the horizon...something dangerous and unexpected...dungeon_14_titleEasterosdungeon_14_level_20_text^No, I'm not scared of giant dragons. Why would I be scared of that? I've never met¬†... ahhhh!dungeon_14_level_19_text`You want to stop me? Ha! You and what Queen's Guard? Oh¬†... uhm, THAT Queen's Guard. I see¬†...dungeon_14_level_18_textZIs he the murderer? He must be the murderer! You can tell by that doe-eyed, innocent look!dungeon_14_level_17_textLMay he show his true face. And may he desist from using such curious speech.dungeon_14_level_16_textrWhatever he's trying to say with those scissors and that thing in his other hand ain't something you want to know.dungeon_14_level_15_textNYour next opponent wants a fair fight? Now that's a girl who's gonna lose! Ha!dungeon_14_level_14_textUIt's suddenly uncomfortably hot in the snow¬†... too hot for a Night Terror like you?dungeon_14_level_13_textwYour next enemy is being shadowed¬†... by a giant wolf, as it turns out. And now that beast also turns on you. Oh dear!dungeon_14_level_12_textÉApproaching the pass you encounter this red-haired vigilante. Why the heck is she so upset with you for killing her two companions?dungeon_14_level_11_text~This one here seems to be particularly "frosty". Where does he come from, anyway? Did you leave a door open in the great wall?dungeon_14_level_10_textäYour next opponent is an honorable fighter through and through. He would certainly never kill someone lying on the ground with a crossbow.dungeon_14_level_09_textGYou almost take pity on this giant. He just can't find shirts his size!dungeon_14_level_08_textÇPhew, that's some scar! How are you supposed to focus on fighting with that on your opponent‚Äôs face? Isn't it against the rules?dungeon_14_level_07_text{The strange, diamond-shaped gesture doesn't bode well¬†... and neither do the two heavily armed giants in gold plate armor.dungeon_14_level_06_textrWith a scornful laugh, your next opponent approaches with what can only be considered a rather threatening stance.dungeon_14_level_05_textåA stranger with a long mane of hair charges at you screaming. Whatever he wants, your best course of action is to try and pull his hair¬†...dungeon_14_level_04_text	Holundor!dungeon_14_level_03_textHWho's that dude? And why are the two women with him armed to the teeth?!dungeon_14_level_02_text£A warrior extends you his hand, but his skin is noticeably colder than normal. Is winter coming again so soon? Show this stranger that you can be cold as ice, too!dungeon_14_level_01_text•You arrive on the other side of the wall and an overweight guy runs towards you, crown askew on his head. You'll have to fight with the strength of a ferocious boar!dungeon_14_comment'"Behind the wall a land doth call¬†..."dungeon_13_titleThe 13th floordungeon_13_level_20_textåYou enter the very last office with the floating boss in it! Duke of Darkness, Herald of Hell, Prince of Perdition, Emperor of Evilness, Commander of Chaos, Archdemon of Agony, Beast of Bane, Viscount of Vileness, Stewart of Satan‚Ä¶but his friends just call him Marv.dungeon_13_level_19_textÒNothing has happened that can‚Äôt be covered with some paint. Where can you find a good painter in hell? As if on cue, a small man with brushes appears. No, this can‚Äôt be real. He holds them between his fingers like a claw and attacks you!dungeon_13_level_18_text®Soft tapping draws your attention. You follow the sound which gets louder and louder. There‚Äôs some kind of kobold sitting at a burning computer, maybe a codebold? Here many new features are developed in the 20-finger system! Suddenly, he hears you and mistypes something. It‚Äôs all your fault!dungeon_13_level_17_text£You‚Äôve had enough pizza and begin to search for answers. It seems as if three new opponents would appear for everyone you defeat. This should only happen in trashy fantasy novels! You are taking some steps forward when suddenly a pickaxe flies past you and gets stuck in a wall, vibrating.dungeon_13_level_16_text®You think they should organize everything themselves. You enter the devastated kitchen and fortunately, it is empty. But what‚Äôs that? Is someone baking a pizza? Far from it! Somebody‚Äôs hiding in the 200 ¬∞C hot oven! As this pizza is not enough for two, you will have to fight for your slice!dungeon_13_level_15_textêOrganization is everything. What everybody knows from home, school or work is even more true in hell. There‚Äôs chaos everywhere. It‚Äôs a good thing that Hellgore the Hellish‚Äôs sister lends a hand here. Actually, she isn‚Äôt his real sister but his sister in suffering.dungeon_13_level_14_textÁAfter this forced musical education you look at a singed scroll. It reads "Translate it by yesterday!" You are wondering what this means when suddenly the Master of Lies steps forward to promise you a pie in the sky‚Ä¶um‚Ä¶in hell.dungeon_13_level_13_text·Your ears are still ringing while you are thinking about the look of the Remastered Version. You really want to address one or two things‚Ä¶Gert is looking forward to your suggestions, but only after beating you with his axe!dungeon_13_level_12_textŒThat was close. You are sneaking along the hallway. Don‚Äôt arouse any attention. You open an office door veeeeery slowly and suddenly, an ill-humored tester of death starts shouting at you with a bullhorn!dungeon_13_level_10_text¥Finally, you‚Äôre approached by a charismatic representative who is ready to compromise. Yes, we‚Äôll adjust the difficulty level. Let‚Äôs seal it with a hammer... uh... handshake.dungeon_13_level_09_textØYou refused to sign a perfectly harmless standard sales slip for your soul. One person in particular isn‚Äôt too pleased about that: Motu with the Club loves players‚Äô souls.dungeon_13_level_08_textëFinally, someone has time for you! The CEO himself is willing to grant you an audience. You just have to sign this one little document. In blood.dungeon_13_level_07_text£You‚Äôre suddenly startled by the sound of breaking glass. Someone tossed a TV with the words ‚ÄúCaution, vicious marketeer‚Äù through the office‚Äôs glass door...dungeon_13_level_06_text∂Behind a massive desk inside an enormous office sits a sinister character, counting money that could have been invested in more difficult dungeons. Would have been. Should have been!dungeon_13_level_05_textñYou decide to contact community support about your complaint and wind up with the KOma KOmmander, who is all too happy to take care of you personally.dungeon_13_level_04_textÒEven during the last battle you felt that someone was watching you the entire time. Suddenly the dreaded Clapper van Hellsing appears, and for some reason he‚Äôs armed with a paint brush. With red paint. Or something that looks just like it.dungeon_13_level_03_textŸYou heard a sound from one of the devastated office spaces. You cautiously take a peek... it‚Äôs probably nothing... but suddenly Jet the Panty Raider jumps out at you. He‚Äôs trying to get in your face - if not more!dungeon_13_level_02_textﬁAfter getting torn up by the Hellgore‚Äôs claws, you‚Äôre visibly cheered by the appearance of a good fairy. She‚Äôs bound come to your aid! But wait a minute - that isn‚Äôt the kind of fairy that makes wishes come true...dungeon_13_level_01_text–You have embarked on the dangerous journey to the 13th floor to complain about the dungeon‚Äôs low difficulty level. The elevator door slowly opens and a small, nasty beast jumps out at you from the darkness.dungeon_13_comment"Get in if you dare!"dungeon_12_titleHelldungeon_12_level_10_textÉThere he is, Beelzeboss. Death and the Devil rolled into one. The dark lord of the underworld. Hmmm... I expected him to be taller.dungeon_12_level_09_text¿He'll help any guilty party get what they're after. If the price is right, he always finds a way. Scruples, a conscience, even a soul? Unprofessional! You want your just dues? You have to pay!dungeon_12_level_08_textƒA disgusting, stinking pile rises up in front of you. It grows to an alarming size, fed by an addled mass of souls and an endless stream of verbal diarrhea. Can you stop the baleful mustached one?dungeon_12_level_07_text+Oooh, how sweet! Does he bite? - Of course!dungeon_12_level_06_textÃHell has specialized workers to make sure it is truly hellish for the inmates. Often, the bosses of game developer studios are lured by specially trained headhunters. This one was particularly successful.dungeon_12_level_05_textrNow the rest of the lost souls have got wind of your arrival. They can hardly wait to give you a proper reception.dungeon_12_level_04_textZWhat happens when an annoying little boy is eaten by a werewolf? You're about to find out.dungeon_12_level_02_text©You probably don't remember every single enemy you've sent to the great beyond on your journeys. But they all remember you. And some of them are still really ticked off.dungeon_12_level_01_text”So, you think you've beaten Death and the Devil? Think again. Beelzeboss will be glad to accept your challenge. With a dull rumble, the door to the underworld opens, and a restless soul rises to bid you welcome.dungeon_12_comment"It can't be THAT bad..."dungeon_11_titleCircus of Terrordungeon_11_level_10_textŸDoesn't he look funny? Sure, his laugh has something diabolical about it, and the balloons he's carrying have been seen in connection with several unsolved murders. But there's no zanier way to die an agonizing death.dungeon_11_level_09_text–The crystal ball never lies, the hunchbacked old woman is sure of that. And for you, the future holds nothing but death and destruction. You cannot escape your fate. All you can do is fight to the bitter end.dungeon_11_level_08_textÆSometimes, you have to bend a little to get ahead in life. Your next opponent has perfected this art. With his bizarre contortions, he can attack you from four sides at once.dungeon_11_level_07_textåNext up is the clown, who frightens not only children, but adults, too! Along with animals, plants, death, and the devil. Let's have a round of applause for Bronco the Joker, the man with the hardest hitting gags and the most brutal punchlines, all way below the belt.dungeon_11_level_06_text–The two guys you're facing now have lived closely together ever since their very complicated birth. The brothers don't particularly like each other, but they've learned to let out their aggressions on others.dungeon_11_level_05_textoOh, a juggler is up next! Look at what all he can do! The question is, can you do it, too? Here! Give it a try!dungeon_11_level_04_text You've seen a lot of strange and terrible things on your journeys. You're accustomed to the sight of the vilest, snarling monsters. You laugh in the face of danger. But this sight leaves you speechless.dungeon_11_level_03_text Escaping the knife thrower's blades by the skin of your teeth, you almost stepped on the next star in the arena. Isn't he cute! But there's something about that belligerent look you really don't like...dungeon_11_level_02_text…The clown was certainly no laughing matter. But somehow, the next attraction leaves you feeling even worse. A figure armed with sharp knives threatens to demonstrate his questionable skills - incoming!dungeon_11_level_01_text◊Sorely marked by the stress and strain of the adventures you have suffered, you think back to your carefree childhood. Suddenly, your face brightens as cheerful music sounds from the distance. The circus is in town!dungeon_11_comment"Humans, animals, monsters!"dungeon_10_title<Black Skull Fortress|"Deep inside there's even a gift shop."dungeon_10_level_10_textØLooking through a tower window, you notice a dark powerful figure waiting just in bailey. It is the Knight of the Black Skull himself who is challenging you to the final duel.dungeon_10_level_09_text™A gigantic dragon of darkness inhabits the main tower. Due to his enormous size, he hasn't been able to leave the tower for many years. It's no wonder he‚Äôs so crabby...dungeon_10_level_08_textπAs you try to enter the main tower, a black skull warrior blocks your way. Something really significant must be hidden there, considering how desperately he wants to stop your progress.dungeon_10_level_07_textøYou enter the great hall... but it turns into a trap, as the door is closed shut behind you. Ahead awaits a dragon that seems to be pretty swamped with all the killing of foolish adventurers.dungeon_10_level_06_text≥You've barely managed to slay the beast, but someone seems to be watching you. The owner of the panther is not pleased with what you did to his pet kitty and wants to have a word.dungeon_10_level_05_text√All of a sudden a grate is opened. The dangerous beast that was kept captive behind it is now enjoying its newfound freedom. The dark shadow that is stalking you turns out to be a hungry panther.dungeon_10_level_04_text≤From out of a dark corner a bad-tempered night troll tries to crack your skull with a blunt object. Fortunately, he misses. Unfortunately, he's getting ready for another swing...dungeon_10_level_03_text√By cutting the drawbridge chain you gain access to the fortress. You do your best to sneak in without causing a commotion. But as soon as you enter the courtyard, a black skull warrior spots you.dungeon_10_level_02_text√A skeleton warrior is guarding the entrance to the black skull fortress. You try to bribe him with a fruit basket, but unfortunately he is allergic to mangoes. A good enough reason for a fight...dungeon_10_level_01_text°A dark rider steps in your way and demands that you turn back. As you ignore his order, he draws his sword to teach you some discipline. And kill you, of course.dungeon_09_title@The Pyramids of Madness|"Don't lose your sanity (or your life)."dungeon_09_level_10_textµOn top of the pyramid you find... a mirror? Suddenly your mirror image steps out of it and attacks you. The situation is getting a little bit crazy. Are you able to defeat yourself?dungeon_09_level_09_textøYou are close to the top of the pyramid as a banshee appears. With much wailing, she predicts the destruction of your mind. Violence seems to be the best way to avoid such an unpleasant fate.dungeon_09_level_08_textñYou try to keep a clear head but all you can think of are pink rabbits. A really malicious pink monster rabbit stops at nothing...even physical abuse.dungeon_09_level_07_textâA terrible demon appears at the top of the pyramid and comes charging towards you. It is muttering to itself while madly swinging an axe.dungeon_09_level_06_textüMeet underworld boss Timmy Suprino, infamous for his pyramid schemes. He wants to make an offer you can't refuse. You draw your weapon and start negotiating...dungeon_09_level_05_text«You are pretty certain that the sight of a ghost must be a hallucination. You clear your mind, you focus... and the ghost is still there. It‚Äôs coming right at you, not afraid to use physical force.dungeon_09_level_04_textœDuring your ascent on the pyramid stairs, you come across the yeti. It is throwing a bone down the stairs, thrilled by the effects of gravity. How much more fun would it be playing this little game with you?dungeon_09_level_03_textµFinally you reach the pyramid. An alien is sitting at its foot. It is scratching its head and enjoying the warm sun. But its relaxed posture changes quickly as soon as it spots you.dungeon_09_level_02_textΩIt has been calm and windless, but all of a sudden a sand storm blows up. Slightly irritated about the reliability of the local forecast, you are trying to deal with this weather situation.dungeon_09_level_01_textòWhat's that, a cave cyclops? How did he get here? Something must be wrong. You should just beat him up quickly and keep on exploring this strange place.dungeon_08_title7The Frost Blood Temple|"Will make your blood run cold."dungeon_08_level_10_text≥The horror that takes hold of you as you encounter this bizarre death machine is beyond words. Its sole purpose is to kill and destroy in an impressive multitude of creative ways.dungeon_08_level_09_textæSuddenly a chirping sound - the language of the extraterrestrials! Another one of those aliens must be nearby... and you are probably already in the sights of its superior weapon technology.dungeon_08_level_08_text´Something is moving in the twilight - a monstrosity from another world! You have the odd feeling that reciting some dialogue from E.T. is not going to solve this conflict.dungeon_08_level_07_text°What a beauty: The dragon of madness has really flourished in the cold surroundings. He is standing right in front of you with a belligerent twinkle in his eyes.dungeon_08_level_06_textΩSuddenly a door opens and bright light streams into the temple. You are blinded for a moment and hardly able to make out what's coming through the door... a creature with a really big head.dungeon_08_level_05_text∏It is really quiet in the temple - too quiet. As you look upwards, you notice an alien from hell dangling from the ceiling. Without further notice, it comes rushing down to attack you.dungeon_08_level_04_text£You make it through the entrance gate and notice a gloomy figure in a cowl. Instead of a warm welcome, you receive cold blows from the fists of an aggressive monk.dungeon_08_level_03_textßShivering from the cold, you are still searching for the temple entrance when a giant dragon swoops down on you. With almost frozen fingers, you reach for your weapon.dungeon_08_level_02_text«You become aware of a hooded figure that has been stalking you, hidden in the shadows of the temple walls. Who is this dark phantom and what does he want from you? You should challenge him to a duel!dungeon_08_level_01_textùThe cold wind whips in your face as you climb up the icy path to the temple. You see something big and furry heading your way. Could this be a fearsome yeti?dungeon_07_title,The Magma Stream|"It's getting hot in here."dungeon_07_level_10_text™You are at the source of the magma stream! Just as you are about to equip your oven mitts in order to switch it off, the ghost of the volcano rises with a rumbling growl.dungeon_07_level_09_text¶Finally you enter the area through which the magma stream is flowing. You are getting closer to its source... and to the giant dragon that is guarding the passageway.dungeon_07_level_08_textùYou examine a suspicious pile of lava rocks carefully. Could it be a lava giant? No, it isn't. Whew! But a real lava giant is standing right behind you. Boo!dungeon_07_level_07_text´You jump back from the flames that burst through the giant crack in the floor that you were just about to cross. They belong to the fire elemental that is about to attack.dungeon_07_level_06_textŒA cyclops scuffles in your direction. He looks cute in his janitor uniform. Underworld management has assigned him to cleaning and maintenance tasks. But he's also pretty good at killing unwelcome visitors.dungeon_07_level_05_text»The floor of the chamber you‚Äôve just entered is covered with ashes. A dragon of darkness waits in the middle. Oh, and the ashes are all that remains from other adventurers who tried to defeat him...dungeon_07_level_04_text√You enter the cavern where the lava stream is supposed to be located. But first you'll have to deal with another issue: A creature forms from a pile of steaming rocks... could it be a lava giant?dungeon_07_level_03_textúYou are just entering the underworld when something emerges from a lava pond. Is it a lava lamp? No, simply an annoying lava blob... might as well fight it.dungeon_07_level_02_text±As you approach the entrance to the underworld, something emerges from the smoke clouds above the lava ponds. This must be the fire basilisk you have been reading so much about.dungeon_07_level_01_text§A fire scorpion is sitting on the warm rock formation. It has been itching to inject its surprisingly deadly poison into the bloodstream of another foolish tourist.dungeon_06_title:The Toxic Tree|"Its roots reach down into infernal deeps."dungeon_06_level_10_textÇThe terrible toxic gremlin is the deadliest mutation ever. He snarls as you approach his hideout. The root of all evil must die...dungeon_06_level_09_textÑLooks like another gremlin attack. What have you done in your former life to deserve this? Slightly annoyed, you prepare for battle.dungeon_06_level_08_textÀIf only the flowers in your front yard would grow as impressively as this member of the Muncher family. Unfortunately the plant blocks your access to the heart of the tree. Time for a little gardening...dungeon_06_level_07_textôA gremlin is hiding in a dark corner. After a long diet, he is looking for his next substantial meal. The rumbling of his stomach warns you just in time.dungeon_06_level_06_textùYou see something furry from a distance. A brown bear? What is this fellow doing in here? He is affected by the plague and charges at you with a mighty roar.dungeon_06_level_05_text†It would have been easy to overlook the greenish gremlin that is lurking in the ooze. You spot him just in time for his attack and start to fight for your life.dungeon_06_level_04_textÆThe green ooze from the tree turns out to be the perfect environment for the Blob species, so it comes as little surprise that a slimy blob starts wobbling towards you. Yuck!dungeon_06_level_03_textûMutated variations of the plague have befallen other creatures that came too close to the tree. The wolf that snarls at you seems to have some sort of rabies.dungeon_06_level_02_text•A gremlin has made himself comfortable in a puddle of green ooze. Displeased about the disturbance, he jumps at you. Better kill him quickly before you get infected!dungeon_06_level_01_textëThe plague that has befallen the tree turns the entrance into a death trap. You‚Äôll have to do some trimming and pruning before you can walk in.dungeon_05_title4The Emerald Scale Altar|"Life is full of sacrifice."dungeon_05_level_10_text≈King Saurus is not that happy to see you. Privacy is really important to him, and he doesn‚Äôt want his ancient temple to become a tourist attraction. What else is he supposed to do but attack you?dungeon_05_level_09_text§The throne room must be behind this ancient gate. A giant toxic dragon - who is looking forward to ending your life in the most painful way - stands in front of it.dungeon_05_level_08_text¢This next area is flooded with foul-smelling, muddy water. All of a sudden a shrieking gorgon appears from the deep. You avert your gaze and feel for your weapon.dungeon_05_level_07_textæThe swamp dragon supposed to be locked away safely in a cage. Unfortunately, someone forgot about the ‚Äòlocking up‚Äô part. Well, you‚Äôve always wanted to be a dragon tamer, haven‚Äôt you?dungeon_05_level_06_textµIn the ancient culture it was the custom to let intruders die a slow, horrible death. The saurus rogue that you encounter here is a traditionalist and very attached to the old ways.dungeon_05_level_05_textÀA giant Rex guards next location. It is sleeping peacefully and you are trying your best to sneak around it... until you trip over an empty soda can and awaken the beast.  Littering is really a nuisance.dungeon_05_level_04_textÔA giant baptismal font is set in the middle of the room. It is filled with mud that reeks of death and decay.  Suddenly a newly baptized Swamp Warrior jumps out of the mud and tries to convince you of his belief... that intruders must die!dungeon_05_level_03_text™Neither peace nor quiet can be found here. The roaring raptor lives up to its name. You grab your earplugs first, then your weapon, to bring silence to this sacred place.dungeon_05_level_02_text«A green reptile blocks your way. If you had paid more attention in school, you would recognize it as a slashing saurus. Fun fact: Its task is to protect sacred altars from intruders such as yourself.dungeon_05_level_01_textÀThe rattling sound of a cobra leads you into catacombs below the altar. In the ancient culture, snakes like this are regarded as holy animals. In today‚Äôs culture, they are regarded as bloody dangerous.dungeon_04_title?The Cutthroat Grotto|"The fight against piracy has just begun."dungeon_04_level_10_textùAs the ship is slowly sinking, you meet the mutated pirate captain on the main deck. He is blaming the damage on you, and asks about your insurance coverage.dungeon_04_level_09_textµSuddenly there‚Äôs a big crash; several planks are bursting and seawater is flooding the cargo area. A gigantic octopus is destroying the ship ‚Äì and eyeing you as a welcome snack.dungeon_04_level_08_textìPirate Blood Nose is hiding behind a crate in the cargo area. He is begging for mercy but you don't fall for his tricks and attack him immediately.dungeon_04_level_07_textúYou are on your way below deck when you are startled by a strange noise from the cargo area. The attacking cutthroat obviously wants to live up to his name.dungeon_04_level_06_text√A mysterious creature dashes across the deck. When you finally get a good look at it, you stare in the mad eyes of a deranged monster rabbit. It is holding a knife that looks uncomfortably sharp!dungeon_04_level_05_textïA sturdy swashbuckler wants to bar you from entering an old ship that is docked here. Fearlessly you start a fight with the pirate... and his parrot!dungeon_04_level_04_text§There is something floating in the water, probably a large tree trunk. As you move closer, the 'trunk' snaps at you... It turns out to be a hungry shadow alligator.dungeon_04_level_03_textüA hero like you must have collected enormous amounts of gold for all your questing. At least that's what this mugger is thinking... and now he wants his share.dungeon_04_level_02_textòAn old sea dog introduces himself as pirate Dark Beard and waves his sword around. You are feverishly trying to figure out what his name might refer to.dungeon_04_level_01_text∞Upon entering the Cutthroat Grotto, you wonder if there‚Äôs something in the wind. It‚Äôs a bit breezy indeed... maybe the attacking wind elemental has something to do with it?dungeon_03_title5The Ruins of Gnark|"Frequented by criminal elements."dungeon_03_level_10_text•You see a wooden door and open it. It leads to the private chambers of the robber chief. All previous opponents seem like small fry compared to this senior criminal.dungeon_03_level_09_textªWhere there is treasure, there are treasure hunters. Somebody else has already cleared the chamber. A grave robber, who is not too pleased to make your acquaintance, is now residing here.dungeon_03_level_08_textõA convenient signpost leads you directly into the treasure chamber, but a chained creature guards it.  The creature breaks free and charges as you enter...dungeon_03_level_07_textµAll of a sudden it‚Äôs suspiciously quiet. Awaiting another ambush, you sneak around carefully. Unexpectedly there are steps behind you ‚Äì a bad bandit is trying hard to knife you.dungeon_03_level_06_textèIt seems that the squatters are keeping wild wolves to guard the ruins. Wishing they had chosen Chihuahuas instead, you get ready for battle...dungeon_03_level_05_textèA scoundrel attacks you with a valuable sword that is probably stolen. With a greedy look, he examines your equipment... oh no, not your shoes!dungeon_03_level_04_textîA rowdy robber guards the next corridor. He uses his dangerous looking knife skillfully to slice a defenseless apple... then sets his sights on you.dungeon_03_level_03_textæYou enter a great hall full of spider webs. You have never seen so many webs... not to mention such big ones. The giant tarantula that was waiting on the ceiling drops down to welcome you...dungeon_03_level_02_textñA dust bat attacks without the least bit of consideration for your dust allergy. Coughing and sniffing, you draw your weapon to exterminate the beast.dungeon_03_level_01_textüThese ruins could use a good cleaning. When was the last time someone vacuumed this place? There are bugs and vermin everywhere. A big ugly rat is chasing you.dungeon_02_title;The Mines of Gloria|"Hi-Ho, Hi-Ho, it's off to work we go."dungeon_02_level_10_text¡The ground is starting to shake, rocks are falling from the ceiling. There's a fissure in the ground and it's getting really hot in here. A creature from hell climbs out of the smoking chasm...dungeon_02_level_09_textÇThe maniacal laughter that suddenly erupts from behind you can only mean one thing: A hideous demon is challenging you to a fight.dungeon_02_level_08_text£Hysterical laughter echoes through the cavern. Red light emanates from a shaft in front of you. Suddenly a furious Succubus starts whirling around and attacks you.dungeon_02_level_07_text£You enter a cavern inhabited by a grim stone troll. He seems to be genuinely happy about your company - it's been way too long since he killed his last houseguest.dungeon_02_level_06_text¥The tunnel makes another turn; something unusually bright seems to be ahead. Maybe the exit? Or a pot of shiny gold pieces? But the light source turns out to be a fire elemental...dungeon_02_level_05_text•Looks like a dead end - the tunnel has probably collapsed. But something is not right here. Suddenly the rocks are moving and a giant creature forms in front of you.dungeon_02_level_04_textóYou keep going, but suddenly something small jumps at your neck and starts to bite. You manage to shake it off - it's a gremlin, ready to strike again!dungeon_02_level_03_text‘The tunnel splits in two directions. The sound of rattling bones can be heard from the dark tunnel to the left. The right tunnel is brightly lit and seems reasonably safe. You decide to go to the left, of course.dungeon_02_level_02_textîYou draw your weapon as you hear a deep growl right behind you. You turn around slowly and see the gigantic yeti that is just about to strike you...dungeon_02_level_01_text{A pair of yellow eyes watches you from a narrow side tunnel. They belong to a hungry water glompf that wants you for lunch.dungeon_01_title7Desecrated Catacombs|"The dead are surprisingly alive."dungeon_01_level_10_text©Finally you enter the main crypt. You feel a cold wind that almost extinguishes all the torches. You hear malicious laughter... a true master of evil is waiting for you.dungeon_01_level_09_textπSuddenly a gate closes behind you. You are trapped... and not alone: You share your prison with a ghastly flesh golem who has been waiting for someone to play with for a very long time.dungeon_01_level_08_textÆYou pass through the gate and enter a large corridor, where you notice mysterious runes on the wall. Before you can investigate them any further, a voodoo master attacks you.dungeon_01_level_07_text¨You see an old gate, guarded by a skeleton warrior. You consider talking your way through it with your superior diplomacy skills, but get attacked straight away. Oh well...dungeon_01_level_06_textòHeart-wrenching cries can be heard in the vault. It is the mourning wail from a banshee that announces your impending demise. Time to prove her wrong...dungeon_01_level_05_textñA terrifying roar is shaking the catacombs - and gives you the shivers. Bravely you venture on and confront the night ghoul that is blocking your way.dungeon_01_level_04_text∑You hear something fluttering in the distance. Is it a tiny moth or perhaps a bat? As it comes closer you realize that the creature ahead is something much bigger - a devious vampire!dungeon_01_level_03_textûYou have already noticed that the buried corpses aren't as dead as they are supposed to be, so you are not overly surprised as an ugly zombie blocks your way.dungeon_01_level_02_text´You look around and notice spiders and rats crawling though the piles of bones on the ground. Suddenly, one of the piles begins to move and turns into a fearsome skeleton.dungeon_01_level_01_textÇImmediately upon entering the dusty vault, you are met by a spooky creature. A wailing ghost is trying fiercely to scare you away.drinkDrinkdownloadingDownloadingdont_ask_againDon't ask again"discard_message_confirmation_titleDiscard Messagediscard_coaDiscarddifficulty_nightmareIIdifficulty_hellIIIdice_throw_paidroll dice (%1)dice_throw_free	roll dicedice_throw_againroll again (%1)dice_start_titleFeel like rolling dice?dice_start_text^5 dice, 2 rolls. Roll the same symbol 3+ times to win! You can reroll any number of dice once.dice_rethrow_titleWhat a pity! Roll again!dice_rethrow_textkYou need the same symbol 3+ times. <info>Select the dice you would like to keep</info> and reroll the rest!dice_limit_titleEnough for today!dice_limit_text4You've played enough dice today. Come back tomorrow!dice_free_timerFree roll in<br>%1dice_claim_rewardClaim rewarddialog_witch_value<tab:10>Reward:<br><tab:15>%1dialog_resale_value"<tab:10>Sales value:<br><tab:15>%1dialog_price<tab:10>Price:<br><tab:15>%1development	Progress:description_placeholder_viewNo description available. description_placeholder_editable/Click here to enter your character description.descriptionDescriptiondemon_life_barHit points: %1%!delete_message_confirmation_titleDelete message? delete_message_confirmation_text#Really delete message "%2" from %1?delete_accountDelete character from serverdeleteDeletedecimal_separator.dealer_product%1 mushroomsdealer_legal_vatAll prices include legal VAT.dealer_legal_links†<link:cancellation>Cancellation policy</link> <link:support>Support</link> <link:tos>ToS</link> <link:privacy>Privacy policy</link> <link:imprint>Imprint</link>dealer_legal_ggsHThis shop is located in Germany. A service provided by Goodgame Studios.dealer_cancellation_legal_ggsÇAll prices include legal VAT. By clicking on "Purchase", you confirm the immediate execution<br> of the contract, hereby losing your cancellation right. <link:cancellation>Cancellation policy</link> <link:support>Support</link> <link:tos>ToS</link> <link:privacy>Privacy policy</link> <link:imprint>Imprint</link> This shop is located in Germany. A service provided by Goodgame Studios.dealer_cancellation_legal¡All prices include legal VAT. By clicking on "Purchase" you confirm the immediate execution of the contract, hereby losing your cancellation right. <link:cancellation>Cancellation policy</link>days_singular%1 daydays_plural%1 daysday_abbreviationddamage_reductionDamage Reductiondamage_range_assassin8Damage L<tab:120>(%1 - %2)<br>Damage R<tab:120>(%3 - %4)damage_rangeDamage<tab:120>(%1 - %2)damage_portal_bonus9<br><attribbonus>+ %1% portal bonus (guild)</attribbonus>damageDamagedaily_quest_title&Confidential Secret Mission of the Daydaily_quest_text_5ÄAttention! The following message is only intended for the recipient! If you have noticed this message on the wall by accident, please ignore it or you have to expect severe contractual penalties. Oh well, here's your daily mission:<br><br><white>%1</white>daily_quest_text_4·This note should be actually encrypted but the plugin no longer works since the update the other day and it always says your key has expired. As an exception, to put it plainly, your daily mission is:<br><br><white>%1</white>daily_quest_text_3ÊSssh...don't look at me! This piece of paper here...yes, go on reading but without looking at it! Fine. Well, here's your daily mission:<br><br><white>%1</white><br><br>Good. Please leave this place now, whistling very innocently.daily_quest_text_2gAttention, attention! We call lizard! Your daily mission:<br><br><white>%1</white><br><br>Over and out!daily_quest_text_1™Hello!<br><br>Your daily mission, should you accept it, reads as follows:<br><br><white>%1</white><br><br>This message will turn into a frog in five seconds and hop away.daily_quest_solved_text∞Congratulations! You've stealthily completed the confidential secret mission of the day!<br><br><white>%1</white><br><br>Now claim your reward unnoticed. And don't tell anyone!daily_quest_description_place	%2 (%1x!)daily_quest_description_9&Defeat an opponent with bare hands %1xdaily_quest_description_7Drink %1 beers in the taverndaily_quest_description_6Complete %1 questsdaily_quest_description_5Win against Assassin heroes %1xdaily_quest_description_47 Win against Berserker heroes %1xdaily_quest_description_46"Win against Battle Mage heroes %1xdaily_quest_description_4Win against Scout heroes %1xdaily_quest_description_3Win against Mage heroes %1xdaily_quest_description_24Win against the gambler %1xdaily_quest_description_23$Defeat a hero in your underworld %1xdaily_quest_description_22Win a fortress attack %1xdaily_quest_description_21(Defeat another player in a pet fight %1xdaily_quest_description_20Feed %1 petsdaily_quest_description_2Win against Warrior heroes %1xdaily_quest_description_19Mine a gem %1xdaily_quest_description_17'Throw an item in the magic cauldron %1xdaily_quest_description_15Increase "Luck" attribute %1xdaily_quest_description_14%Increase "Constitution" attribute %1xdaily_quest_description_13%Increase "Intelligence" attribute %1xdaily_quest_description_12"Increase "Dexterity" attribute %1xdaily_quest_description_11!Increase "Strength" attribute %1xdaily_quest_description_10+Throw an epic item in the arcane toilet %1xdaily_quest_description_1Win against other heroes %1xdaily_login_bonusDaily Login Bonus)customize_character_gender_and_class_textHGender: <white>%1</white><br>Class: <white>%2</white><br><grey>%3</grey>customize_character_folk_text*Race: <white>%1</white><br><grey>%2</grey>	crit_longCrit. hit chancecrit_attribute_explanationZ= %1 * 5 / (enemy level * 2); max. 50%<br></grey>Critical hit damage bonus<grey><br>= 100%critCritical Hit#create_units_insuffic